<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- WOL</book>
  <para style="h">Yowaan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu, ci jottalib Yowaan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yowaan</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jean</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xibaaru jàmm bu Almasi Yeesu,</para>
  <para style="mt2">ci jottalib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Yowaan kenn la woon ci taalibey Yeesu. Yowaan moo nettali juróom ñaari kéemaan yu Yeesu def, te muy lu wees ay kéemaan, maanaam ay firnde yu wone kan mooy Yeesu ak li ko Yàlla yónni ngir mu def ko ci àddina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ni ñu ko daaje ca bant ba, moo sottal liggéey bu mag bi ko Yàlla dénk, te liggéey bi mooy baaxe nit ñi réer, di leen jéggal. Li Yonent Yàlla Yaxya wax rekk, moom «mooy Xarum Yàlla, miy far bàkkaaru àddina» (1.29).</para>
  <para style="im">Ci tënk:</para>
  <para style="ili">1.1-18 Kàddu gi moo ñëw ci àddina.</para>
  <para style="ili">1.19-51 Yaxya yégle na ñëwug Yeesu, ba wonale ko ak taalibey Yeesu yu njëkk ya.</para>
  <para style="ili">2.1—12.50 Yeesu wone na juróom ñaari firnde, jàngal na mbooloo.</para>
  <para style="ili">13.1—19.42 Yeesoo ngii ci fanam yu mujj ci biir Yerusalem ak li ko wër.</para>
  <para style="ili">20.1—21.25 Yeesu dekki na, ba feeñu ay taalibeem.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Almasi bi moo di Kàddu gi, di leer gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Njàlbéen ga fekk na Kàddu gi nekk, te Kàddu gi ma nga woon ak Yàlla, te Kàddu gi Yàlla la woon. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Njàlbéen ga fekk na Kàddu gi nekk ak Yàlla. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Lépp ci Kàddu gi lañu ko sàkke. Sàkkeesul dara lu ñu sàkkewul ci moom. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ci moom la dund nekk, te dund dig leer, ñeel nit ñi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Leer moo feeñ ci biir lëndëm, te lëndëm gi manu koo man.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Am na nit ku Yàlla yebal, ñu di ko wax <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char>. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Kooku moo dikke kàddug seede, ngir seede lu jëm ci leer gi, ngir ñépp gëme ciy waxam. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Du moom ci boppam moo doon leer gi, waaye seedeel leer gi moo ko taxa dikk.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Leer giy dëgg, tey leeral nit ñépp, moo dikk ci àddina. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ci àddina la masa nekk, te àddina sàkkoo ci moom, waaye waa àddina xamuñu ko. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ci ñoñam la ñëw, waaye ñoñam a ko dalalul. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Teewul mboolem ñi ko dalal, ba gëm ko, ñoom la may ñu yelloo doon doomi Yàlla. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ñooñu du ci deret lañu sosoo, te it du ci coobarey nitu suuxu neen, mbaa ci coobarey góor lañu sosoo, waaye ci Yàlla lañu sosoo.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Kàddu gee sol aw suux, doon nit, màkkaanoo ci sunu biir, nu ne jàkk ci darajaam, darajay jenn Doom ji bawoo ci Baay bi, mat sëkk ci aw yiw akug dëgg.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Moom la Yaxya seedeel, di xaacu ne: «Kii laa noon leen: “Mooy dikk sama gannaaw waaye moo ma sut, nde moo jiitu sama juddu.”»<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ci ag matam lanu tanqe nun ñépp, yiw ci kaw yiw. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Yoon wi indi ndigali Yàlla yi, ci gémmiñu Musaa lees ko joxee, waaye yiw wi ak dëgg gi, ci Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi la dikke. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kenn masula gis Yàlla, waaye Yàlla miy Kenn te sës rëkk ci Baay bi, kooku mooy ki ko xamle.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya seedeel na Almasi bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Lii nag moo di seedes <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char>, ba njiiti Yawut ya yebalee fa moom ay <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> aki <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñu jóge Yerusalem, dikk ne ko: «Yaw yaay kan?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yaxya dafa biral, bañula tontu, waaye daa biral ne: «Duma <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ñu ne ko: «Yaay kan nag? Yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Ilyaas:">Ilyaas</char>?» Mu ne leen: «Duma Ilyaas.» Ñu ne ko: «Ndax yaa di Yonent bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yonent bi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 18.15, 18. Bànni Israayil am na yonent bu bokk ci seen askan bu ñu doon séentu.</note>?» Mu ne leen: «Déedéet.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ñu ne ko nag: «Wax nu yaay kan, ba nu mana yóbbul tont ñi nu yónni. Nga ne yaa di kan?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Mu ne: «Man maa di baatu kiy xaacu ci màndiŋ mi, naan: “Nangeen xàll yoonu Boroom bi!”» noonu ko Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> waxe woon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 40.3.</note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> nag a nga woon ca ña ñu yebal ca Yaxya. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Ñu laaj ko ne ko: «Ana kon looy sóobe ci ndox, gannaaw doo Almasi bi, doo Ilyaas, doo Yonent boobu?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yaxya ne leen: «Man de maa ngi sóobe ci ndox, waaye nit a ngi fii ci seen biir te xamuleen ko. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Kookooy ñëw sama gannaaw, te buumi caraxam sax, man yeyoowuma ko koo feccil.»<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Lii ca Betani la xewe woon, ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan, fa Yaxya daan sóobe.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu moo di Xarum Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ca ëllëg sa, ba <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> gisee Yeesu di dikk wutsi ko, da ne: «Kii mooy Xarum Yàlla, miy far bàkkaaru àddina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 53.7-8; <char style="bk">1.Piyeer</char> 1.19.</note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Kii laa noon leen: “Nit kiy ñëw sama gannaaw moo ma sut, nde moo jiitu sama juddu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Man ci sama bopp xàmmeewuma ko woon, waaye xamal ko <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> moo ma taxa dikk, di sóobe ci ndox.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ci kaw loolu Yaxya seede ne: «Maa gis <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> wàcce asamaan, ni am pitax, toŋ ci kawam. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Man nag xàmmeewuma ko woon, waaye ki ma yebal ba may sóobe ci ndox moo ma ne: “Ki nga gis Noo gu Sell gi wàcc, toŋ ci kawam, kooku mooy sóobe ci Noo gu Sell gi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Maa gisal sama bopp te maa seede ne kii moo di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci ñi njëkka topp Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ca ëllëg sa <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> dellu taxaw, mook ñaari taalibeem. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Naka la Yeesu di romb, Yaxya ne ko jàkk, ne: «Kii moo di Xarum Yàlla!»<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ñaari taalibe ya dégg la mu wax, daldi topp ca Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yeesu ne gees, gis ñu topp ci moom. Mu ne leen: «Lu ngeen bëgg?» Ñu ne ko: «Rabbi,» muy firi kilifa gi, «ana foo dal?»<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yeesu ne leen: «Kaayleen, gis.» Ñu dem ba gis fa mu dal. Loola yemook ñeenti waxtu ci ngoon. Ñu daldi toog fa moom la des ca bëccëg ba.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Ku ñuy wax Simoŋ Piyeer nag moo bokk ndey ak baay ak Àndre, miy kenn ca ñaar ña déggoon la Yaxya wax, ba tax ñu topp Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Simoŋ moomu Àndre bokkal, la Àndre njëkka seeti, ne ko: «Gis nanu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi,» muy firi Ki ñu fal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.41 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ki ñu fal: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">moom lañuy wax Kirist itam ci làkku gereg.</char></note>! <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Mu yóbbu Simoŋ ba ca Yeesu. Yeesu ne ko jàkk, ne ko: «Yaa di Simoŋ, doomu Yowaan. Dees na la woowe <char style="w" lemma="Sefas:">Sefas</char>,» muy firi doj.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu woo na Filib ak Natanayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ca ëllëg sa Yeesu fas yéenee dem Galile. Ci biir loolu mu daje ak Filib. Yeesu ne ko: «Toppal ci man.»<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filib, Betsayda la dëkkoon, dëkkub Àndre ak Piyeer. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filib nag dem ba ca ku ñuy wax Natanayel, ne ko: «Ki Musaa bind ci téereb yoon wi, ki yonent yi bind ci mbiram, gis nanu ko; Yeesu doomu Yuusufa la, Nasaret la dëkk!» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayel ne ko: «Mbaa lu baax man naa jóge Nasaret yee?» Filib ne ko: «Ñëwal gis.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ba Yeesu gisee Natanayel jëmsi ca moom, wax na ca moom, ne: «Nitu Israayil dëgg a ngii; gennug caaxaan nekkul ci moom.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayel ne ko: «Foo ma xame?» Mu ne ko: «Bala laa Filib a woo, ba nga nekkee ca suufu figg ga, laa la gis.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanayel nag ne ko: «Kilifa gi, yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, yaa di buurub Israayil!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yeesu ne ko: «Li ma ne la, gis naa la ca suufu figg ga moo la taxa gëm? Lu raw loolu ngay gis.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Mu teg ca ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy te muy lu wér, dingeen gis asamaan ubbiku, malaakay Yàlla yiy yéeg aka wàcce ci kaw <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu def na kéemaan ca Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ca gannaaw ëllëg sa, ag céet a amoon ca Kana ga ca diiwaanu Galile. Yaayu Yeesu nag ma nga fa woon. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yeesu aki taalibeem itam, woo woon nañu leen ca céet ga. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ca biir bernde ja, biiñ ba dem ba jeex. Yaayu Yeesu ne Yeesu: «Ñii de, seen biiñ jeex na.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yeesu ne: «Soxna si, lu tax nga di ma wax loolu? Sama waxtu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sama waxtu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bu ko Yeesu waxee, dafa wax ci bésu deewam. Seetal ci Yowaan 17.1. Mi ngi xalaat ci li ko nara dal ngir mu nekk boroom këru mbooloom ñi ko gëm. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Efes</char> 3.25.</note> jotagul.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Teewul yaayam ne surga ya: «Lu mu leen wax, defleen ko.»<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Juróom benni ndaayi doj yu ñu yatt a nga fa woon, Yawut ya daan ca jàppe; ndaa lu ci nekk mana def juróom ñett fukk ba téeméeri liitar. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yeesu ne surga ya: «Duyleen ndaa yi ba mu fees.» Ñu duy ndaa yi, ba mu rembat. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yeesu ne leen: «Léegi tanqleen ci, yót ko njiitu xew wi.» Ñu tanq, yót ko. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Njiitu xew wa mos ndox ma, ndeke soppaliku na biiñ. Xamul fu biiñ ba jóge, teewul surga ya tanq ndox ma, ñoom xam nañu ko. Njiit la woo boroom séet ba, ne ko: <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />«Mboolem kuy xew, biiñ bu neex lay njëkka joxe; bu nit ñi naanee ba doyal, mu doora taaj bu yemamaay. Yaw nag nga denc bu neex bi ba nëgëni!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Lii Yeesu moo ko def fa Kana gu diiwaanu Galile, muy ndoorteli firndeem. Ni la firndeele darajaam, ba ay taalibeem gëm ko.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Gannaaw loolu la dem Kapernawum, mook yaayam aki rakkam aki taalibeem. Waaye tooguñu fa fan yu bare.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dàq na jaaykat ya ca kër Yàlla ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Màggalu Yawut gi ñuy wax <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">bésub Mucc</char> moo jubsi woon. Yeesu nag dem Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ba mu agsee ca ëttu kër Yàlla ga, ay jaaykati nag la fa fekk ak jaaykati xar ak jaaykati pitax ak weccikati xaalis yu toog. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Mu defar kàcciri gu mu ràbbe ay buum, dàqe leen ko, génne kër Yàlla ga, ñoom ñépp, ak xar yaak nag ya. Ci biir loolu mu tasaare xaalisu weccikat ya, dëpp taabal ya. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Jaaykati pitax ya, mu ne leen: «Jëleleen fi lii! Buleen def sama kër Baay, kërug jaayukaay!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Taalibeem ya nag fàttaliku la ñu bind ne: «Damaa xér ci sa kër gi, ba jeex tàkk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 69.10.</note>.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ba loolu amee njiiti Yawut ya ne ko: «Lii ngay def, jan firnde nga nuy jox, ba sañ koo def?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yeesu ne leen: «Yàqleen kër Yàlla gii, ma yékkatiwaat ko ci ñetti fan.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yawut yi nag ne ko: «Kër Yàlla gii ñu tabax ci ñeent fukki at ak juróom benn, yaa koy yékkatiwaat ci ñetti fan?»<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Waaye Yeesu kër Yàlla ga mu doon wax, yaramu boppam la woon. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Gannaaw ba Yeesu deewee ba dekki nag, la taalibeem ya fàttaliku loolu mu waxoon. Ñu daldi gëm li Mbind mi indi, ak kàddu ga Yeesu waxoon.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />La Yeesu toog Yerusalem ca màggalu bésub Mucc, ñu baree ko gëm, ba ñu gisee firnde ya muy def. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Waaye Yeesu moom, taxul mu wóolu leen, ndax ñoom ñépp la xamoon, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />te it soxlawul kenn xamal ko nit, ndax moom ci boppam xam na li ci nit.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu waar na waarekatub bànni Israayil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Am na nit ku bokkoon ca <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya, ku ñuy wax Nikodem, di njiit ca Yawut ya. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kooku moo dikk ag guddi ba ca Yeesu ne ko: «Kilifa gi, xam nanu ne ab kilifa nga bu bawoo fa Yàlla, nde kenn manula def firnde yii ngay def, te du Yàllaa ànd ak moom.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maa la ko wax déy ci lu wér, nit ki, su judduwaatul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">judduwaat: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci làkku gereg, baat bi Yeesu wax mi ngi tekki «judduwaat» walla «juddoo ci kàttan gu jóge ci kaw».</char></note>, du mana gis nguurug Yàlla.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodem ne ko: «Ana nu nit di judduwaate te xasa dem bay mag? Daa mana duggaat ci biiru yaayam, ngir judduwaat?»<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maa la ko wax déy ci lu wér, nit ki su juddoowul ci ndox ak ci <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char>, du mana tàbbi ci nguurug Yàlla. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Lu juddoo ci nitu suuxu neen, nitu suux la, lu juddoo ci Noowug Yàlla nag, ag noo la. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Li ma la ne: “Fàww ngeen judduwaat,” bumu la jaaxal. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Ngelaw fu ko neex lay gelawe; coowam ngay dégg, waaye xamuloo fu mu jóge, xamuloo fu mu jëm. Noonu la it ci képp ku juddoo ci Noowug Yàlla.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodem neeti ko: «Loolu nu mu mana ame?»<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yeesu ne ko: «Yaw ngay jàngalekat bu mag ci <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> te xamuloo loolu? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Maa la ko wax déy, ci lu wér; li nu xam, nu ngi koy wax; li nu gis, nu ngi koy seede, yeen kay yeena baña gëm li nu seede. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Gannaaw mbiri àddina laa leen wax, gëmuleen ko, su ma leen waxee mbiri asamaan, ana nu ngeen koy gëme? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kenn masula yéeg fa asamaan ku moy ki wàcce asamaan, te mooy <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Kàddu yu xelu</char> 30.4.</note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Te itam noonee Musaa yékkatee woon jaan ja ca màndiŋ ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Màndiŋ ma</char> 21.9.</note>, fàww ñu yékkatee ni Doomu nit ki, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ngir képp ku ko gëm, texe ba fàww.»<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ndax Yàlla moo sopp àddina, ba joxe jenn Doomam ji, ngir képp ku ko gëm, texe ba fàww, te du sànku mukk. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ndax kat Yàlla yebalul Doomam ci waa àddina ngir daan waa àddina, waaye musal waa àddina, mucc gu sottee ci Doomam, moo tax mu yebal ko. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Képp ku ko gëm, deesu la daan, waaye ku ko gëmul, daanees na ko ba noppi, ndax moo gëmul jenn <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> ji. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Àtteb daan bi nii la tëdde: leer moo dikkal àddina, waaye nit ñi la lëndëm gënal leer ndax seen jëf yu bon. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Képp kuy def jëf ju sew, day bañ ag leer te du dikk ci leer gi, ngir ragal ay jëfam feeñ. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Waaye kiy def liy dëgg, ci leer gi lay dikk, ngir mu leer nàññ ne déggal Yàlla la ko jëfe.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaxya nangu na ne Yeesu moo sut lépp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu ànd ak ay taalibeem, dem diiwaanu Yude. Mu toog fa ak ñoom ab diir, di sóob nit ñi ci ndox. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ci biir loolu <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> itam di sóobe ci ndox ca Aynon, wetug Salim, ndax diiwaan bu bare ndox la woon. Nit ñi di ko fa fekk, mu di leen sóob ci ndox. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Booba tëjaguñu Yaxya kaso.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Werante nag am diggante ñenn ci taalibey Yaxya ak ab Yawut, ci mbirum setlu gi seen yoon laaj. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Ci kaw loolu ñu dikk ca Yaxya ne ko: «Kilifa gi, ka nga dajeeloon ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan, te nga seedeeloon ko ag kàddu, moom de ma ngay sóobe ci ndox, ñépp jëm ca moom!» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yaxya ne leen: «Nit manula am lenn lu ko Yàlla joxul. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Yeen ci seen bopp, yeenay samay seede ne maa noon man duma <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, waaye dees maa yebal ngir ma jiitusi Almasi boobu. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Kiy séetal moo moom ab séetam. Waaye xaritu boroom séet bi day taxaw di ko déglu, bu déggee baatu boroom séet bi, bég. Mbég moomu nag laa moom, te mat na sëkk. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Moom mu gën di kawe, te man ma gën di suufe mooy li war.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Ki jóge ci kaw moo féete ñépp kaw; ki jóge ci suuf nag, ci suuf la bokk, te mbiri suuf lay wax. Waaye ki jóge asamaan moo féete ñépp kaw. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />La mu gis ak la mu dégg lay seede, waaye kenn du gëm kàddug seedeem. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ku nangu kàddug seedeem nag yaa nangu ne Yàllaa wax dëgg. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yàlla kat, ku mu yebal, kàddug Yàlla lay wax, ndax Yàlla du natt li mu koy nàddil cig <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowam</char>. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Baay bi moo sopp Doom ji, te lépp la teg ciy loxoom. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ku gëm Doom ji, yaay texe ba fàww; ku baña gëm Doom ji nag, doo gis googu texe, waaye sànjum Yàlla mooy dëkk ci sa kaw.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu feeñu na ndaw su dëkk Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Ba Yeesu yégee nag ne <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya dañoo dégg ne Yeesu moo ëpp <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> taalibe yu muy tuubloo, di leen sóob ci ndox, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />doonte du woon Yeesu ci boppam moo doon sóobe, waaye taalibey Yeesu la woon, <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />ca la jóge Yude, dellu diiwaanu Galile.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Woowu yoon nag, <char style="w" lemma="Samari:">Samari</char> la waroona jaare. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ci kaw loolu mu dem ba agsi dëkkub Samari ba ñuy wax Sikar, ca wetu tool ba <char style="w" lemma="Yanqóoba:">Yanqóoba</char> mayoon doomam Yuusufa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Foofa la teenub Yanqóoba nekkoon. Fekk na coonob tukki ba jàpp Yeesu. Mu toog ca wetu teen ba, waxtu wu xawa yemook digg bëccëg.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Senn ndawas Samari dikk, di rootsi. Yeesu ne ko: «May ma, ma naan.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Booba ay taalibeem dem nañu dëkk ba, ngir jëndi lu ñu lekk.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Yaw miy Yawut, ana noo ma mana ñaane ndoxum naan, man, te may waa Samari?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:9">Ndax Yawut yi séquñu woon ak waa Samari lenn.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yeesu nag ne ndaw si: «Soo xamoon mayu Yàlla, ak kan moo la ne may ma, ma naan, kon yaw yaa koy ñaan, mu may la ndox miy dundal.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Sang bi, amuloo baag, te teen bi xóot na; ana fooy jële ndox miy dundal? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Dangaa sut sunu maam Yanqóoba, mi nu may teen bi, te naan ci, mooki doomam akug juram?»<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ku naan ci miim ndox it, dina maraat, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />waaye ku naan ci ndox mi ma koy may, man, du marati; ndox mi ma koy may, bëtu ndox lay doon ci moom, di ball, ngir dundug texe gu sax dàkk.»<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Sang bi, may ma ci moomu ndox, ba duma marati, mbaa may dikkati fii, di root.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yeesu ne ko: «Demal woowi sa jëkkër te ñëw.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Awma jëkkër.» Yeesu ne ko: «Wax nga dëgg, amuloo jëkkër, <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />ndax juróomi jëkkër nga séyal, te ki nga am léegi du sa jëkkër. Kon dëgg nga wax.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Sang bi, gis naa ne yaw ab yonent nga. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Nun nag, sunuy maam ca tund wee lañu daan jaamoo Yàlla, te yeen Yawut yi, yeena ne béreb ba jaamu Yàlla ware, ma nga ca Yerusalem.»<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ndaw sile, lii ma lay wax, gëm ko: waxtoo ngi ñëw, du ci tund wii, te du Yerusalem lees di jaamoo Baay bi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Yeen waa Samari, yeenay jaamu lu ngeen xamul. Nun Yawut yi, li nuy jaamu, xam nanu ko, ndax ag mucc, ci Yawut yi lay jóge. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Waaye waxtoo ngi ñëw, te léegi la; ci la jaamukat yi dëgg di jaamoo Baay bi xel ak dëgg, ndax ñu ni mel la Baay bi sàkku ñu jaamu ko. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Yàlla xel la<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yàlla xel la: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kàddug Yàlla nee na, Yàlla xel la, leer la, cofeelu neen la. Seetal ci 1.Yowaan 2.4.</char></note>, kon ñi koy jaamu, xel ak dëgg lañu ko war di jaamoo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ndaw si ne ko: «Xam naa ne <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> baa ngi ñëw, moom lañu naan Ki ñu fal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ki ñu fal: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">moom lañuy wax Kirist itam ci làkku gereg.</char></note>, kooku bu dikkee, moo nuy leeralal lépp.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man miy wax ak yaw, man la.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taalibey Yeesu ya délsi nañu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Cooca la taalibey Yeesu dikk, daldi jaaxle ca lañu ko fekk muy wax ak as ndaw, waaye kenn newu ko: «Loo soxla?» mbaa: «Lu tax ngay wax ak ndaw si?»<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ndaw sa nag wacc fa njaqam, dem ca dëkk ba, daldi ne nit ña: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Kaayleen gis; nit a nga fee, wax na ma mboolem lu ma def! Kooku du <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> beem?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ñu génne ca dëkk ba, wutsi Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ci biir loolu taalibe ya di ko soññ, naan ko: «Kilifa gi, lekkal.» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Teewul Yeesu ne leen: «Am naa ñam wu ma lekk, te woowu ñam, yeen xamuleen ko.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Taalibe ya nag naan ca seen biir: «Ndax dees koo indil ag lekk?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yeesu ne leen: «Samaw ñam moo di jëfe coobarey ki ma yónni, ba sottal ab liggéeyam. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Du yeena naan: “Fii ak ñeenti weer ngóob taxaw”? Dégluleen, ma wax leen: dawalleen seen bët, xool tool yi, ñu ngi weex tàll, di xaar am ngóob. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Góobkat baa ngi feyeeku xaat, tey dajale meññeef mi ngir texe gu sax dàkk, ba jikat bi ak góobkat bi bokk bég. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Loolu lañu léeb te muy dëgg, ne: “Kenn ji, keneen góob.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Man maa leen yebal ngir ngeen góob fu ngeen ñaqul woon, yeen. Ñeneen a fa ñaq, ngeen dikk jariñoo seenu ñaq.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waa Samari ñu bare gëm nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Dëkk boobu, niti <char style="w" lemma="Samari:">Samari</char> ñu baree fa gëm Yeesu, ndax kàddug ndaw sa seede woon ci Yeesu, ne: «Wax na ma mboolem lu ma def.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Moo tax ba waa Samari dikkee ca Yeesu, dañu koo ñaan, ngir mu dal ak ñoom. Toog na fa ñaari fan. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ci kaw loolu ñu gëna bare gëm ko ndax kàddoom. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ñu wax ndaw sa nag ne ko: «Dootul li nga wax a nu taxa gëm, waaye nun noo déggal sunu bopp, ba gis ne kii moo di Musalkatub àddina bi.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na doomu dagu buur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Gannaaw ñaari fan yooyu la fa Yeesu jóge, jëm diiwaanu Galile, <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />ndax Yeesu ci boppam moo noon: «Ab yonent, réewu boppam, deesu ko fa nawe.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ba mu agsee Galile, waa Galile dalal nañu ko, ndax gis nañu mboolem la mu defoon ca Yerusalem, ca <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char> ba, ndax ñoom itam demoon nañu ca màggal ga.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Ci kaw loolu mu délsi Kana gu Galile, dëkk ba mu soppee woon ndox ma biiñ. Amoon na fa ab dagu buur bu doomam wopp ca dëkk ba ñuy wax Kapernawum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ba mu déggee ne Yeesu jóge na Yude, ba agsi Galile, dafa dem ca moom, ñaan ko mu dikk, wéral doomam, ndax booba ma ngay waaja dee. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yeesu ne ko: «Su ngeen gisul ay firnde ak kéemaan daal, dungeen gëm!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Dagu buur bi ne ko: «Sang bi, dikkal, bala sama doom a dee!» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yeesu ne ko: «Demal, sa doom a ngi dund.» Waa ja gëm kàddu ga ko Yeesu wax, daldi dem. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Naka lay dellu këram, ay surgaam gatandu ko, ne ko: «Sa doom a ngi dund!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Mu laaj leen wan waxtu la tane, ñu ne ko: «Démb, ci benn waxtu ci bëccëg, la tàngooru yaram teqalikoo ak moom.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Baay ba nag xam ne ca waxtu woowa la ko Yeesu noon: «Sa doom a ngi dund.» Ca la gëm Yeesu, moom ak waa këram gépp.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Lii moo di ñaareelu firnde ba Yeesu def ca Galile, gannaaw ba mu jógee Yude.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na ab jarag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Gannaaw loolu, ag màggal la Yawut ya xewle woon, ba tax Yeesu dem Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ca Yerusalem nag, fa feggook buntu dëkk ba ñu dippee buntu Xar ya, ab déeg a nga fa woon, ñu di ko woowe ci làkku yawut, Betesda, te juróomi mbaar a nga fa woon. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ci mbaar yooyu la jarag ju bare daan tëdd; ay gumba, ay làggi aki lafañ, di xaar ndox mi yëngu, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />ndax am malaakam Boroom bi lañu foogoon ne daan na fa wàcc ci yenn bés, te bu ndox ma yëngoo, jarag bu jiitu ca biir ndox ma, wopp joo amoon, day wér ca saa sa.<verse eid="JHN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Jenn waay a nga fa woon, fanweeri at ak juróom ñett la nekk ak woppam. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Kooku la Yeesu gis mu tëdd, mu xam ne yàgg na fa. Mu ne ko: «Ndax bëgg ngaa wér?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Jarag ji ne ko: «Sang bi, damaa amul ku ma sóob ci ndox mi, bu yëngoo. Bu ma cay jëm, keneen jiitu ma, tàbbi ca.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yeesu ne ko: «Jógal, jël sa basaŋ te dox.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mu wér ca saa sa, jël basaŋam, daldi dox.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Bés booba <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> la woon. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Loolu nag tax njiiti Yawut ya ne nit kay doora wér: «Tey bésub Noflaay la, mayeesu la nga gàddu sa basaŋ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Mu ne leen: «Ki ma wéral moom moo ma ne: “Jëlal sa basaŋ te dox.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ñu ne ko: «Ana nit ku la ne: “Jëlal sa basaŋ te dox”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Waa ji nag xamul ka ko wéral ku mu doon, te fekk na Yeesu dem ba réer ca biir mbooloo mu bare ma teew foofa.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu dajeek moom ca kër Yàlla ga, ne ko: «Ma ne, léegi wér nga. Bul bàkkaarati nag, bala laa lu ko yées di dikkal.»<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab sañ-sañ ñeel na Doomu Yàlla ji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Ba loolu amee waa ja dem, ne Yawut ya Yeesu moo ko wéral, <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />ba loolu tax Yawut ya di bunduxataal Yeesu, ndax <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> ba mu ko defe. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Teewul Yeesu ne leen: «Sama Baay a saxoo liggéey, man itam may liggéey.»<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kàddu googu nag tax njiiti Yawut yi gën koo wuta rey, ndax du ndigalu bésub Noflaay bi mu xëtt doŋŋ, waaye itam la mu ne Yàlla mooy Baayam, di nawlante ak Yàlla.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yeesu dellu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, Doom ji manula def dara ci jëmmu boppam, lu moy li mu gis Baay bi def ko, ndax lu mu def, loolu itam la Doom ji di def. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Baay bi moo sopp Doom ji, ba won ko lépp lu muy def, te jëf ju raw jii la koy won, ngir ngeen waaru, <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />ndax kat, ni Baay bi di dekkale ñi dee, dundal leen, noonu la Doom jiy dundale ku mu namma dundal. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Baay bi du àtte kenn; Doom ji la dénk àtte bi bépp, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ngir ñépp teral Doom ji, ni ñu terale Baay bi. Ku teralul Doom ji, teraloo Baay bi ko yónni.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, ku dégg sama kàddu ba gëm ki ma yónni, yaa texe ba fàww, te àtte ba, doo ca jaare, waaye bàyyikoo nga ci dee, tàbbi ci dund. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, waxtu waa ngi ñëw, te léegi la; mooy waxtu wi ñi dee di dégg baatu <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, te ñi ko dégg ñooy dundaat. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ndax kat ni Baay bi jagoo dund ci jëmmu boppam, noonu la maye Doom ji mu jagoo dund ci jëmmu boppam, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />te sañ-sañu amal àtte bi itam, moom la ko jox, ndax mooy <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />«Bu leen ci dara jaaxal; waxtoo ngi ñëw wu mboolem ñi ci biir bàmmeel, di dégg baatam, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ba génn; ñi daan def lu baax añe ndekkitel dund, ñi daan def lu bon añe ndekkitel mbugal. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Man, manumaa def dara ci sama jëmmu bopp; ni ma dégge rekk laay àttee, te sama àtte jub na, nde sàkkuwuma sama coobarey bopp, xanaa coobarey ki ma yónni.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sañ-sañu Yeesu am na ay firnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Su ma seedeelee sama bopp, sama kàddug seede wérul. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Keneen a ma seedeel, te xam naa ne dëgg la ma seedeel.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />«Yeena yónnee ca <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char>, Yaxya seede dëgg. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Man nag soxlawuma seedes nit; waaye dama leena wax lii ngir ngeen mucc. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yaxya moo doon làmp buy tàkk, di leer, ngeen bége leeram ay fan.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />«Waaye man ci sama bopp maa ngeek seede su raw si ma Yaxya seedeel, ndax liggéey yi ma Baay bi dénk, ngir ma sottal ko, liggéey yooyu may liggéey moo may seedeel ne Baay bi moo ma yebal. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Baay bi ma yónni, moom ci boppam seedeel na ma. Masuleena dégg baatam mbaa ngeen gis kanamam, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />te kàddoom dëkkul ci seen xol, ndax ki mu yebal, ngeen gëmul. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Yeena ngi gëstu Mbind mi, ndax ci ngeen yaakaara ame texe gu sax dàkk, yooyu bind nag far seedeel ma, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />te bëgguleena ñëw ci man, ba texe!<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«Ngërëmal nit, sàkkuwuma ko. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Waaye yeen, xam naa leen; cofeelu Yàlla nekkul ci yeen. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Man, maa dikk ci sama turu Baay, te dalaluleen ma, waaye keneen ku dikk ci turu boppam, kooku ngeen di dalal. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Yeen, ngërëm, ci seen biir ngeen koy sàkkoonte, te sàkkuwuleen ngërëmal Yàlla miy kenn. Kon ana nu ngeen mana gëme?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />«Buleen defe ne maa leen di boole ak Baay bi. Ki leen di boole mooy Musaa, mi ngeen yaakaar. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Bu ngeen gëmoon Musaa, gëm ma, nde moom, ci sama mbir la bind<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 18.15.</note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Waaye su ngeen gëmul bindi Musaa, nu ngeen di gëme samay wax?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu leel na mbooloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu jàll ca wàllaa dexu Galile, ga ñuy wax dexu Tiberyàdd itam. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mbooloo mu bare topp ca moom, ndax ñoo gis firnde ya mu wérale jarag ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yeesu yéeg ca kaw tund wa, daldi toog foofa ak ay taalibeem. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Booba màggalu Yawut ga ñuy wax <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">bésub Mucc</char>, jubsi na. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yeesu dawal bëtam, gis mbooloo mu réy mu dikk, jëm ca moom. Mu ne Filib: «Fu nuy jële mburu mu nu leen leele?»<verse eid="JHN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Loolu nag da koo wax ngir seetlu Filib, ndax moom ci boppam xamoon na la mu nar. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filib ne ko: «Peyug juróom ñetti weer sax jëndul mburu mu leen doy, ba kenn ku nekk ci ñoom am ci ndog su tuut.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Àndre, keneen ca taalibe ya, te bokk ak Simoŋ Piyeer ndey ak baay, ne ko: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Ab xalee ngi fi de, am na juróomi mburu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mburu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mburu yu ndaw lañu, yu ñu defare sungufu lors. Moo doon lekku ñi néew doole.</char></note> ak ñaari jën, waaye loolu lu mu jariñ ñu tollu nii?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yeesu daldi ne: «Toogalleen nit ñi.» Ñax mu baree nga woon ca béreb booba. Góor ña nag toog, seenub lim wara tollu ci juróomi junni (5 000). <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yeesu jël mburu ya, yékkati kàddug cant, daldi ko séddale ña fa toog. Jën ya itam noonu, ñu lekk ba doyal.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ba ñu lekkee ba regg, Yeesu ne taalibeem ya: «Dajaleleen desiti mburu mi, ba dara du ci yàqu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ñu dajale ba feesal fukki pañe ak ñaar ci dogi juróomi mburu ya ñu lekk ba desal.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ba nit ña gisee firnde jooju Yeesu def, dañu ne: «Kii daal, dëgg-dëgg mooy Yonent bi dikk ci àddina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yonent bi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 18.15.</note>!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yeesu nag gis ne dañoo nara dikk, jàpp ko yóbbu, ngir fal ko buur, mu daw dellu, moom kenn ca tund wa.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dox na ci kaw ndox</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ba jant sowee, taalibeem ya dem ca tefes ga. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Ci kaw loolu ñu dugg gaal, ngir jàll jëm Kapernawum, ndax booba lëndëm na te Yeesu agseegul. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Dex ga nag yëngu lool, ndax ngelaw lu jóg ak doole. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ba taalibe ya joowee lu tollook juróomi kilomet ba juróom benn, Yeesu lañu séen, muy dox ca kaw dex ga, jëm ca gaal ga, ñu daldi tiit. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yeesu ne leen: «Man mii la, buleen tiit!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ñu door koo nangoo dugal ca gaal ga. Ci kaw loolu gaal ga teeri ca saa sa, fa ñu jëm.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ca ëllëg sa mbooloo ma des ca geneen wàllaa dex ga, seetlu ne genn gaal doŋŋ a fa nekkoon, te Yeesu àndul woon ak taalibe ya ca gaal ga ñu dugg, waaye taalibe ya rekk a dem. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Gannaaw gi la yeneen gaal jóge Tiberyàdd, teersi fa feggook béreb ba nit ña lekke woon mburu ma, gannaaw ba Sang bi yékkatee kàddug cant. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ba mbooloo ma gisee nag ne Yeesu ak taalibe ya, kenn nekku fa, gaal yooyu lañu dugg, dem seeti ko Kapernawum.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu mooy ñamu dund</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ci kaw loolu ñu fekk Yeesu ca geneen wàllaa dex ga, ne ko: «Kilifa gi, kañ nga fi ñëw?»<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, yeen du firnde yi ngeen gis a tax ngeen di ma seet, waaye mburu mi ngeen lekk ba regg moo tax. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Ñam wuy yàqu, bumu leen taxa liggéey; liggéeyalleen ñam wi sax, ñam wiy texeel fàww, te <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki moo leen koy jox, ndax moom la Yàlla màndargaal, ngir firndeel ne moom la tànn.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ñu ne ko: «Ana lu nuy def, ba jëfe jëf ji neex Yàlla?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yeesu ne leen: «Jëf ji neex Yàlla, mooy ngeen gëm ki mu yebal.»<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ñu ne ko: «Jan firnde ngay def, nu gis ba gëm la? Ana jëf joo nu mana defal? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Sunuy maam de, <char style="w" lemma="mànn:">mànn</char> lañu dunde ca màndiŋ ma, te noonu lañu binde ne: “Peppum asamaan la leen leel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 78.24; <char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 16.</note>.”»<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yeesu neeti leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy, ci lu wér, du Musaa moo leen jox ñamu asamaan, sama Baay la, te moo leen jox tey ñamu asamaan dëgg. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ndaxte ñamu Yàlla mooy ki wàcce asamaan te kooku moo may àddina ñu dund.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ñu ne ko nag: «Sang bi, dee nu may saa su ne ci woowu ñam!»<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yeesu ne leen: «Man maay ñam wiy joxe dund. Ku ñëw ci man, doo xiif mukk; te ku ma gëm, doo mar mukk. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Waaye wax naa leen ko; gis ngeen ma, te taxul ngeen gëm! <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Képp ku ma Baay bi jox dina ñëw, te man, ku ñëw ci man, duma ko dàq mukk. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Def sama coobarey bopp taxul ma wàcce fa asamaan, waaye def coobarey ki ma yónni moo tax. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ki ma yónni nag, coobareem moo di mboolem ñi mu ma jox, buma ci ñàkk kenn, waaye naa leen dekkal kera bés bu mujj ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ndax sama coobarey Baay kat moo di képp ku gis Doom ji te gëm ko, na texe ba fàww, te maa koy dekkal keroog bés bu mujj ba.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Yawut ya nag di ñurumtoo Yeesu, ndax la mu ne: «Man maay ñam wi wàcce fa asamaan.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ñu naan: «Xanaa kii du Yeesu, doomu Yuusufa? Nun, nu xam baayam, xam ndeyam. Ana nu mu mana waxe ne asamaan la jóge?»<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yeesu ne leen: «Baleen ñurumtu bi ci seen biir. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kenn manula ñëw ci man te Baay bi ma yónni indiwu ko; te ku ñëw ci man, maa koy dekkal kera bés bu mujj ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Bindees na ci téerey yonent yi ne: “Ñoom ñépp ay jànge ci Yàlla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 54.13.</note>.” Kon nag képp ku dégg Baay bi, ba déggal àlluwaam, dina ñëw ci man. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Tekkiwul ne kenn mas naa gis Baay bi. Xanaa ki bawoo fa Yàlla, kookoo gis Baay bi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Maa leen ko wax déy, ci lu wér, ku gëm, yaa texe ba fàww. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Man maay ñam wiy joxe dund. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Seeni maam a lekk mànn ca màndiŋ ma, te dee nañu. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Waaye ñam wii mooy wi wàcce fa asamaan, ngir ku ko lekk, du dee. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Man maay ñam wiy dund te wàcce fa asamaan. Ku lekk ci wii ñam, mooy texe ba fàww. Ñam woowu nag mooy samaw suux; maa ko joxe, ngir àddina dund.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ci kaw loolu Yawut ya di werante werante wu tàng ci seen biir naan: «Ana nu nu kii mana joxee aw suuxam, nu lekk?»<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, bu ngeen lekkul ci suuxu Doomu nit ki, naan deretam, amuleen dund ci seen jëmmi bopp. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Képp ku lekk samaw suux, naan sama deret, texe nga ba fàww, te maa lay dekkal kera bés bu mujj ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ndaxte sama yaram mooy ñam wi wóor, sama deret di naan gi wóor. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Képp ku lekk sama suux, naan sama deret, ci man lay dëkk, ma dëkk ci moom. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ni ma Baay biy dund yebale, te may dund ndax moom, noonu la ki ma lekk di dunde ndax man. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Woowu ñam mooy wi wàcce fa asamaan; bokkul ak ñam wa seeni maam lekkoon te teewuleena dee. Ku lekk wii ñam, yaay texe ba fàww.»<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Baat yooyu la Yeesu wax, ba muy jàngale ca jàngub Yawut ba, ca Kapernawum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taalibey Yeesu yu bare xàcc nañu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Taalibey Yeesu yu bare, ba ñu déggee loolu, dañu ne: «Gii kàddooka jafe! Ana ku ko mana dégg?»<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yeesu nag yég ci boppam ne taalibeem yaa ngi ñurumtoo loolu. Mu ne leen: «Xanaa kàddu gii mbetteel la leen def? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Kon bés bu ngeen gisee <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> kiy yéeg jëm fa mu njëkkoona nekk nag? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> mooy dundloo; nitu suuxu neen manul dara. Kàddu gi ma leen wax moo leen di jottali Noowug Yàlla giy taxa dund. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Waaye am na ñenn ñu bokk ci yeen, ñu gëmul.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:64">Ndax kat Yeesu xamoon na ca njàlbéen ñan ñooy ña gëmul woon, ak kan mooy ka koy wor. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Mu teg ca ne: «Looloo tax ma ne leen kenn manula ñëw ci man, te du Baay bi moo ko ko may.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Booba la taalibeem yu bare dëpp, àndatuñu ak moom. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yeesu nag ne fukki taalibe yaak ñaar: «Yeen itam bëgg ngeena dem am?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoŋ Piyeer ne ko: «Sang bi, ci kan lanu jëm? Kàddu giy texeel fàww, yaa ko yor! <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Nun gëm nanu te ràññee nanu ne yaa di Aji Sell ju Yàlla ji.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa du man maa leen tànn, yeen Fukk ak ñaar? Ndaxam kenn a ngi bokk ci yeen te ab seytaane la!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yuda doomu Simoŋ Iskaryo la doon wax, ndax mooy ka ko doon waaja wor, te ca Fukk ñaak ñaar la bokkoon.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dem na ca màggalu Mbaar ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu diiwaanu Galile la doon wër. Bëggul woona doxe biir diiwaanu Yude, ndax njiiti Yawut ya ñoo ko doon wuta rey.<verse eid="JHN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ci biir loolu màggalu Yawut gi ñuy wax <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">Mbaar yi</char>, jubsi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Rakki Yeesu yu góor ya ne Yeesu: «Jógeel fii te dem diiwaanu Yude, ngir say taalibe, ñoom itam, gis jaloore yi ngay def. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kenn du jëfe biir kumpa tey wuta feeñ. Gannaaw yaay def yii jaloore, wonal sa bopp àddina,» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />ndax booba ay rakkam sax gëmuñu ko woon.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yeesu ne leen: «Sama waxtu jotagul; yeen nag, seen waxtu bopp, bés bu nekk la. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Àddina du leen mana bañ, waaye man la bañ, ndax maa koy seedeel ne ay jëfam dafa bon. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Yeen nag demleen màggal ga, man demuma ca màggal googu, ndax sama waxtu jotagul.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Loolu la leen wax, daldi des ca Galile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Teewul ba rakki Yeesu demee ca màggal ga, Yeesu itam dem na ca, waaye siiwalul aw yoonam, daanaka daa làqu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yawut ya nag di ko seet, naan: «Ana waa ji?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ci kaw loolu déeyoo bi ci mbiram bare ca mbooloo ma. Ñii naan: «Nit ku baax la.» Ñee naan: «Déedéet, day naxe.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Waaye taxul kenn waxe mbiram ca kaw, ndax ragal njiiti Yawut ya.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu jàngale na ca màggal ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ba ñu demee ba ca diggu màggal ga, Yeesu dem ca kër Yàlla ga, di jàngale. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yawut ya jaaxle, naan: «Kii nu mu ame bii xam-xam te jàngul?»<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yeesu daldi leen wax ne leen: «Li may jàngale, moomuma ko, ki ma yebal a ko moom. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ku namma jëfe coobarey Yàlla, dina xam ndax li may jàngale ci Yàlla la jóge, am ci sama coobarey bopp laay waxe. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Kiy wax ci coobarey boppam nag, darajay boppam lay sàkku, waaye ki bëgga fésal darajay ki ko yónni, kooku ku dëggu lay doon, te ag njubadi du nekk ci moom. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Xanaa du Musaa moo leen jox ndigali yoon wi? Ndaxam kenn ci yeen jëfewul yoon wi! Ana lu ngeen may wuta rey?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mbooloo ma ne ko: «Yaw rab a la jàpp! Ku lay wuta rey?»<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yeesu ne leen: «Jenn jaloore doŋŋ laa def, yeen ñépp ngeen waaru! <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ndigalu xarafal gi leen Musaa jox, doonte jógewul ci Musaa, waaye cay maam la ba tey, tax na ngeen di xarafale ci <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> sax. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Gannaaw nit ay xaraf ci bésub Noflaay, ngir yoonu Musaa baña tebbiku, ana lu ngeen ma meree ndax nit ku ma wéral péŋŋ ci bésub Noflaay? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Bàyyileen di àttee li leen seen bët may, deeleen àttee dëgg.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndax Yeesu mooy Almasi bi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ci kaw loolu ñenn ci waa Yerusalem naan: «Xanaa du kii lees di wuta rey? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Te mu ngii ne fàŋŋ di waare, te waxuñu ko dara. Xanaa sunu kilifa yi dañoo xam ne kii mooy <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Moonte kii, xam nanu fu mu bokk, te su Almasi bi dikkee, kenn du xam fu mu bokk.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu di jàngale ca kër Yàlla ga, daldi biral ne: «Kon xam ngeen ma, xam fi ma bokk? Ndaxam du ci sama coobarey bopp laa dikke, te ki ma yónni, ku wóor la. Yeen nag xamuleen ko. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Man maa ko xam, ndax ci moom laa bàyyikoo, te moom moo ma yebal.»<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ba mu ko defee ñu di ko wuta jàpp, waaye kenn tegu ko loxo, ndax waxtoom moo jotagul woon. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Teewul ñu bare ca mbooloo ma gëm ko, te naan: «Almasi bi sax, bu dikkee, ndax dina def firnde yu ëpp firnde yi nit kii def?» <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" /><char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya dégg loola mbooloo may déeyoo ci mbirum Yeesu. <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak Farisen ya daldi yebal ay wattukati kër Yàlla ga, ngir ñu jàppi ko.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yeesu nag ne: «Diir bu gàtt laay toogaat ak yeen, doora dem ca ki ma yónni. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Dingeen ma seet, waaye dungeen ma gis; te man fa may nekk, yeen, dungeen fa mana dem.»<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yawut ya naan ca seen biir: «Kii fu muy waaja jëm, fu ñu ko dul gise? Xanaa ca Yawut ya dëkki ca jàmbur ña? Xanaa jàmbur ña lay jàngali? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ak luy tekkitel kàddu gii mu wax, ne: “Dingeen ma seet, waaye dungeen ma gis; te man fa may nekk, yeen dungeen fa mana dem?”»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Bés ba mujj ca màggal ga nag moo ca gënoona màgg. Keroog la Yeesu taxaw, àddu ca kaw ne: «Ku mar, na ñëw ci man, naan; <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />ku ma gëm, ay dex ay balle cib dënnam, di wal ndox muy dund! Te noonu la ko Mbind mi indee.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Booba <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> la doon wax, Noo ga gëmkati Yeesu doon waaja jot, te jotaguñu ko woon, ndax booba, Yeesoo tàbbeegul woon ci teraangaam.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ba ñenn ca mbooloo ma déggee kàddu yooyu, dañu ne: «Aylayéwén kii mooy Yonent bi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ñeneen naan: «Kii mooy Almasi bi!» Teewul mu am ñu naan: «Galile, nu fa Almasi biy jógee? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Du Mbind mi moo wax ne, Almasi bi ci xeetu <char style="w" lemma="Daawuda:">Daawuda</char> lay soqikoo, ca Betleyem, dëkk ba Daawuda fekk baax<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mise</char> 5.1; <char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 89.4-5.</note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Féewaloo nag am ca mbooloo ma ndax Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Ñenn ca ñoom bëggoon nañu koo jàpp, waaye kenn tegu ko loxo.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Njiiti Yawut yi gëmuñu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ba loolu amee wattukat ya dellu ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya. Ñooñu ne leen: «Lu tax indiwuleen ko?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wattukat ya ne leen: «Nit masula waxe ni kii!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farisen ya ne leen: «Kon yeen itam nax nañu leen a? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ndax yeena gis ci njiit yi mbaa ci Farisen yi, kenn ku ko gëm? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Xanaa mbooloo mii xamul yoonu Musaa, te ñu alku lañu!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodem bokk na ca Farisen ya fa nekkoon, te demoon na seeti Yeesu lu jiitu loolu. Mu ne leen: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Sunuw yoon ndax dina daan nit te njëkkeesu koo déglu, boole ci xam lu mu def?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ñu ne ko: «Xanaa yaw itam ci diiwaanu Galile nga bokk? Gëstul, kon dinga xam ne Galile, ab yonent du fa feeñe.»<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ba loolu amee ku nekk ñibbi këram.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jigéenu njaalookat mucc na ci ab daan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yeesu moom, dem ca <char style="w" lemma="tundu Oliw y-:">tundu Oliw</char> ya. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ca ëllëg sa ca njël, mu dellu ca kër Yàlla ga, ña fa nekk ñépp dikk, mu toog, di leen jàngal. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Firikati yoonu Musaa ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya nag indi as ndaw su ñu jàppoon ci njaaloo, taxawal ko ca diggu mbooloo ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Ñu ne Yeesu: «Kilifa gi, ndaw sii, dañu koo jàpp ci njaaloo. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Ci sunuw yoon nag, Musaa moo santaane ne jigéen ñii, dees leen di sànni ay xeer ba ñu dee. Yaw nag, ana loo ciy wax?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Kàddu googu dañu ko ko doon seetloo, ba am lu ñu ko tiiñale. Teewul Yeesu sëgg, di bind ak baaraamam ci suuf. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Naka lañu ko toppe ay laaj, mu siggi ne leen: «Ku masula bàkkaar ci yeen, na njëkka sànni ndaw si xeer.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ci kaw loolu mu sëggaat, di rëdd ci suuf.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ba nit ña déggee loolu, kenn-kenn lañu rocceeku, ña gën di mag jiitu. Yeesu doŋŋ a fa des, mook ndaw sa fa taxaw. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Mu daldi siggi ne ko: «Ndaw sii, ana nit ñi? Kenn joxu la ci sab daan?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Mu ne ko: «Kenn, Sang bi.» Yeesu ne ko: «Man it duma la daan. Demal, te bul bàkkaarati.»<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Li Yeesuy wax mooy dëgg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yeesu waxati leen ne leen: «Man maay leeru àddina. Ku ma topp doo dox cig lëndëm, waaye leeru dund ngay am.»<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya ne ko: «Yaw yaa seedeel sa bopp, kon li nga wax wérul.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa seedeel sama bopp, te teewul sama kàddug seede di lu wér, ndax xam naa fa ma bàyyikoo, xam fa ma jëm. Yeena xamul fa ma bàyyikoo ak fa ma jëm. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Yeen, seen bindu suuxu neen ngeen di àttee ab daan; man nag duma àttee kenn ab daan. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Teewul nag, su ma dee àtte, samab àtte dëgg lay doon, nde du doon man doŋŋ, waaye maak Baay bi ma yebal lay doon. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Te itam bindees na ci seenu yoon ne seedes ñaari nit mooy li wér<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Baamtug yoon wi</char> 19.15.</note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Man may kenn, seedeel sama bopp, te Baay bi ma yónni itam seedeel na ma.»<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ñu ne ko: «Kuy sa baay?» Yeesu ne leen: «Xamuleen ma, xamuleen sama Baay. Su ngeen ma xamoon, xam ko, moom itam.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ba Yeesu di wax loolu, ma ngay jàngale ca béreb ba ñuy denc xaalisu sarax, ca kër Yàlla ga. Booba kenn jàppu ko, ndax waxtoom a jotagul woon.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yeesu neeti leen: «Man, maa ngi dem; dingeen ma seet, waaye seen bàkkaar ngeen di deewaale. Man, fa ma jëm, yeen dungeen fa mana dem.»<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Yawut ya nag naan: «Xanaa day xaruji? Ndax kat nee fa mu jëm, dunu fa mana dem!» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yeesu ne leen: «Yeen, fu suufe fii ngeen bokk, waaye man fa kaw laa bokk. Yeen, ci àddina ngeen bokk, waaye man bokkuma fi àddina sii. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Moo tax ma ne leen, seeni bàkkaar ngeen di deewaale. Ndax kat su ngeen gëmul ne maay Ki nekk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">maay Ki nekk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy turu Yàlla, wi mu feeñal yonentam Musaa, te ëmb melow Yàlla wu sax. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 3.14.</note>, seeni bàkkaar ngeen di deewaale.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ñu ne ko: «Yaw yaay kan?» Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa ki ma leen waxoon ca njàlbéen. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Am naa lu bare lu ma mana wax ci yeen ak lu ma leen àttee. Waaye ki ma yónni, ku dëggu la, te man, li ma dégge ci moom doŋŋ laay àgge àddina.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Booba xamuñu ne ci Yàlla Baay bi la leen di wax. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yeesu nag ne leen: «Bu ngeen yékkatee <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki, dingeen xam ne man maay Ki nekk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">maay Ki nekk: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci 8.24.</char></note>, te duma def dara ci sama wàllu bopp, waaye li ma Baay bi jàngal rekk laay wax. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Te it ki ma yónni moo ànd ak man; bàyyiwu ma, ma wéet, ndax man, li ko neex doŋŋ laay def.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ñu bare, ba ñu déggee Yeesu muy wax loolu, ca lañu ko gëm.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu ŋàññ na waa kër Ibraayma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yeesu moo waxoon Yawut yi ko gëmoon ne leen: «Bu ngeen saxee ci sama kàddu, samay taalibe dëgg ngeen. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Su boobaa dingeen xam liy dëgg, te dëgg gi moo leen di goreel.»<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Ñu ne ko: «Nun askanu Ibraayma lanu, masunoo doon jaamu kenn. Kon ana loo nu naa dees na nu goreel?»<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, képp kuy bàkkaar, ab jaamu bàkkaar la. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Te ab jaam bokkul ci kër gi ba fàww, doom a bokk ci kër gi ba fàww. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Kon nag su leen Doom ji goreelee, ngeen diy gor tigi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Xam naa ne askanu Ibraayma ngeen. Waaye yeena ngi may wuta rey, ndax sama kàddu ngeen xajoowul. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Man, li ma gis ci sama Baay laay wax, te yeen it li ngeen dégge ci seen baay ngeen di def.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ñu ne ko: «Sunu baay Ibraaymaa.» Yeesu ne leen: «Su ngeen doon doomi Ibraayma, jëfi Ibraayma ngeen di def. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Waaye tey yeena ngi may wuta rey; man, nit ku leen àgge dëgg gu mu dégge fa Yàlla. Loolu de Ibraayma defu ko. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Yeen, seen jëfi baay ngeen di def.» Ñu ne ko nag: «Nun de, dunu doomi moykat, te benn baay doŋŋ lanu am, muy Yàlla.»<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doomi Seytaane, jëfi Seytaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yeesu ne leen: «Su Yàlla doon seen Baay, ngeen sopp ma, nde man, fa moom laa bàyyikoo, dikk. Dikkuma it ci sama coobarey bopp, waaye moom moo ma yebal. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Lu waral xamuleen sama wax? Dangeena manula dégg sama kàddu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Yeen ci seen baay <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> ngeen bokk, te seen xemmemtéefi baay ngeen namma def. Ca njàlbéen la dale di ab bóomkat. Masula taxaw ci dëgg, ndax dëgg a nekkul ci moom. Buy fen, jikkoom la topp, nde mooy fen-kat te di baayu fen. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Man nag, dëgg laay wax, moo tax gëmuleen ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Kan ci yeen moo mana firndeel ne bàkkaar naa? Gannaaw dëgg laay wax nag, lu tax yeen, gëmuleen ma? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ku bokk ci Yàlla, déglu ay kàddoom. Gannaaw dégguleen nag, bokkuleen ci Yàlla.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu junj na darajaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yawut ya ne ko: «Xanaa yeyunu nag, ba nu nee nitu <char style="w" lemma="Samari:">Samari</char> nga, te aw rab a la jàpp?»<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yeesu ne leen: «Man de, aw rab jàppu ma; sama Baay laay teral, yeen ngeen di ma teddadil. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Man nag, sàkkuwuma sama darajay bopp, waaye am na ku ma koy sàkkul, te mooy àtte. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Maa leen ko wax déy, ci lu wér, ku sàmm sama kàddu, doo dee mukk.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yawut ya ne ko: «Léegi nag wóor nanu ne aw rab a la jàpp! Ibraayma dee, yonent yi dee, yaw nga naay: “Ku sàmm sama kàddu, doo dee mukk!” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ndax yaw yaa gën sunu maam Ibraayma mi dee, te yonent yi itam dee? Koo teg sa bopp?»<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yeesu ne leen: «Su ma dee darajaal sama bopp, sama daraja amul solo. Sama Baay a may darajaal, ki ngeen ne mooy seen Yàlla. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Xamuleen ko nag; man maa ko xam. Su ma noon xawma ko, di fen-kat ni yeen. Waaye xam naa ko te kàddoom laay sàmm. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Seen baay Ibraayma bànneex bu réy la doon séentoo sama bés. Gis na ko it, ba am ci mbégte.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yawut ya ne ko: «Amaguloo juróom fukki at, te gis nga Ibraayma!» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yeesu ne leen: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, balaa Ibraaymaa juddu, man maa nekk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci 8.24.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ca lañu for xeer yu ñu ko sànnee, ngir rey ko. Teewul Yeesu làqu, ba génn kër Yàlla ga.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu faj na gumbag judduwaale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yeesu moo doon dem, ba gis jenn waay ju judduwaale gumba. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Taalibeem ya laaj ko ne ko: «Kilifa gi, ndax bàkkaaram a ko waral, walla bu waajuram, ba tax mu judduwaale gumba?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yeesu ne leen: «Du bàkkaaram, du bàkkaaru waajuram a tax. Da di liggéeyu Yàlla moo wara feeñe ci moom. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Danoo wara liggéey liggéeyu ki ma yónni ci bi muy bëccëg; bu guddee kenn du liggéey. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Li feek maa ngi ci àddina, maay leeru àddina.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Loolu la Yeesu wax ba noppi, tifli fa suuf, tooyale ban ba lor wa, daldi diw bàq ba ca bëti gumba ga, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ne ko: «Demal sëlmuji ca bëtu ndoxu Silowe.» Silowe di firi Ki ñu yónni. Gumba ga sëlmuji, délsi di gis.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Dëkkandoom ya ak ña ko xame woon yalwaan, naan: «Xanaa du kii moo daan toog, di yalwaan?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ñii naan: «Moom la!» Ñee naan: «Déedéet, da koo niru rekk.» Waa ji ci boppam ne: «Man la de!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ñu ne ko: «Lu muri say bët?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Mu ne leen: «Waa ji ñuy wax Yeesu moo tooyal ban, diw ko ci samay bët, ne ma: “Demal sëlmuji ca bëtu ndoxu Silowe.” Ma dem sëlmuji, di gis.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Ñu ne ko: «Ana waa ji?» Mu ne leen: «Xawma fu mu nekk.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka gumba woon seedeel na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ba mu ko defee ñu yóbbu nit ka gumba woon ca <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ndeke <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> la Yeesu tooyaloon ban ba, ba muri bëti gumba ga. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Loolu nag tax Farisen ya ñoom it, laaj ko nan la wére bay gis. Mu ne leen: «Ban la tooyal, diw ko ci samay bët, ma sëlmu, di gis.»<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ñenn ca Farisen ña nag naan: «Nit kii jógewul fa Yàlla, ndax sàmmul bésub Noflaay.» Ñeneen ña ne: «Nan la nitu neen kuy bàkkaar mana defe yii firnde?» Féewaloo daldi am ca seen biir. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Farisen ya dellu wax ak ka gumba woon, ne ko: «Yaw, loo wax ci moom, gannaaw yaw la muril say bët?» Mu ne leen: «Ab yonent la.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Njiiti Yawut ya nag gëmuñu woon ne waa ja daa gumba woon bay doora gis noonu. Ñu daldi woolu waajuri ka gumba woon, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />laaj leen ne leen: «Kii mooy seen doom ji ngeen ne gumba la judduwaale? Ana nu mu wére bay gis léegi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Waajur ya ne leen: «Xam nanu daal ne kii sunu doom la, te it gumba la judduwaale. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Waaye nu mu wére bay gis, xamunu ko; ki ko muril ay bëtam it, nun, xamunu ko. Laajleen ko, magum jëmm la; moom dina waxal boppam.»<verse eid="JHN 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Noonu waajuri waa ja waxe nag, ragal njiiti Yawut ya moo taxoon, ndax fekk na njiiti Yawut ya mànkoo ne képp ku seede ne Yeesu mooy <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, dees na ko dàqe ca jàngu ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Looloo waral waajur ya ne: «Magum jëmm la, laajleen ko moom.»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Farisen ya dellu woo ka gumba woon, ne ko: «Waxal sa digganteek Yàlla. Nun xam nanu ne waa jooju nit kuy bàkkaar la.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mu ne: «Su dee kuy bàkkaar de, xawma ci dara. Lenn laa xam: maa gumba woon, te léegi maa ngi gis.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ñu ne ko: «Lu mu la defal? Nu mu muree say bët?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Mu ne leen: «Wax naa leen ko ba noppi, yeena dégluwul. Lu ngeen bëgg ci ma di ko waxaat? Xanaa yeen itam dangeena bëgga doon ay taalibeem?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ñu daldi ko saaga ne ko: «Yaw yaay taalibeb kii, waaye nun, taalibey Musaa lanu. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Nun xam nanu ne Musaa la Yàlla waxal, waaye kii, xamunu fu mu jóge.»<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Waa ja ne leen: «Loolu kay mooy li yéeme! Yeen, xamuleen fu mu jóge, te mu muril ma samay bët! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Xam nanu ne kuy bàkkaar, Yàlla du ko déglu. Waaye ki ragal Yàlla, tey jëfe coobareem, kooku lay déglu. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ba àddina sosoo ba tey, maseesu la dégg ku muri bëti gumbag judduwaale. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Kon nit kii, su jógewul woon ca Yàlla, du mana def dara.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Ñu ne ko: «Ndax yaw mi fees ak bàkkaar, bi nga juddoo ba léegi, yaa nuy xaali?» Ci kaw loolu ñu dàqe ko ca jàngu ba.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cilmaxa dëgg, ci xol la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ba Yeesu déggee ne dàq nañu waa ja gumba woon, dafa dem ba gis ko, ne ko: «Yaw, ndax gëm nga <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Waa ja ne ko: «Kooku kan la, Sang bi, ma gëm ko.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yeesu ne ko: «Gis nga ko; mooy kiy wax ak yaw.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Mu ne ko: «Gëm naa la, Sang bi,» daldi koy sujjóotal. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man, ab àttee ma taxa dikk ci àddina sii, ngir ñi dul gis di gis; ñiy gis, gumba.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ay <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yu taxawoon ca wetam dégg ca, ne ko: «Xanaa nun it danoo gumba?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yeesu ne leen: «Su ngeen gumba woon, dungeen am bàkkaar, waaye léegi bi ngeen naa yeena ngi gis, ci ngeen di saxe ci bàkkaar ba furr.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu nee ku jaare ci moom, mucc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />«Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, ku duggewul ci buntu wërmbalu xar yi, xanaa mu yéege feneen, tëb, kooku ab sàcc la, ab saay-saay la. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Waaye ki dugge ci buntu wërmbal bi, kookooy sàmmub xar yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Kooku la wattukat biy ubbil, xar yi di déglu baatam. Mooy woo xari boppam ci seen tur, génne leen. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bu génnee xaram yépp ba noppi, da leen di jiitu, ñu topp ci moom, ndax xàmmee nañu baatam. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ab jàmbur nag, duñu ko topp mukk; dañu koy daw kay, ndax xàmmeewuñu baatub jàmbur.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Léeb woowu la Yeesu léeb ci kanamu nit ñi, waaye ñoom xamuñu la mu leen wax. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu neeti: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, man maay buntu wërmbalu xar yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Mboolem ñi ma jiitu, ay sàcc aki saay-saay lañu, waaye xar yi dégluwuñu leen. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Man maay bunt bi; ku dugge ci man, dinga mucc, di dugg aka génn, di gis mbooy goo fore. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Ab sàcc moom, dara indiwu ko lu moy sàcc aka rey aka yàq. Man maa ñëw, ngir nit ñi dund dund gu naat.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />«Man maay sàmm bi baax<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esekiyel</char> 34.15-16.</note>. Sàmm bu baax, bakkanam lay joxe, jote ko ay xaram. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Kuy sàmmaan di feyeeku te dub sàmm, moomuli xar; bu séenee bukki buy dikk, day bàyyi xar ya, daw, bukki ba jàpp ca, tasaare la ca des. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Ab sàmmaan kuy feyeeku rekk la, xalaatul xar ya, moo tax muy daw.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />«Man maay sàmm bi baax. Maa xam sama xari bopp, ñoom it ñu xam ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Noonu it laa xame Baay bi, Baay bi xame ma ni, te maay joxe sama bakkan, jote ko xar yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Am naa it yeneen xar yu bokkul ci bii wërmbal. Ñoom it fàww ma indi leen, te dinañu dégg sama baat. Su ko defee muy gennug coggal, di bennub sàmm. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Li tax Baay bi sopp ma, moo di sama bakkan laa joxe, ba man koo jëlaat. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kenn du jële sama bakkan ci man; man maa koy joxeel sama bopp. Maa ko saña joxe, maa ko saña jëlaat, te loolu la ma sama Baay sant.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Féewaloo nag amati ca Yawut ya, ndax kàddu yooyu. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ñu bare ca ñoom naan: «Aw rab a ko jàpp! Dafa dof! Lu ngeen koy dégloo?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ña ca des naan: «Jii wax du waxi ku rab jàpp. Ndax aw rab man naa muri bëti gumba?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yawut ya gàntal nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Bés ba ñuy baaxantal daloog kër Yàlla ga la woon ca Yerusalem, yemook jamonoy sedd. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yeesoo nga doon doxantu ca kër Yàlla ga, ca mbaar ma ñuy wax Mbaarum Suleymaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yawut ya yéew ko ne ko: «Loo deeti xaar ci dindil nu kumpa; su dee yaa di <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, wax nu lu leer!»<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yeesu ne leen: «Wax naa leen ko, yeena gëmul. Man, jëf ji may def ci sama turu Baay moo may seedeel. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Waaye yeen yeena gëmul, ndax bokkuleen ci samay xar. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Samay xar, sama baat lañuy déglu; maa leen xam, te man lañuy topp. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Man maa leen di texeel ba fàww; duñu sànku mukk, te kenn du leen foqatee ci sama loxo. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Sama Baay bi ma leen jox, moo gëna màgg lépp, te kenn manula foqatee lenn ci loxol Baay bi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Man ak Baay bi benn lanu.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yawut ya nag foratiy xeer yu ñu ko sànni, ngir rey ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yeesu ne leen: «Jëf ju baax ju bare laa def ci ndigalal Baay bi. Ana ci yooyu jëf, jan ngeen ma nara sànnee ay xeer ba rey ma?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Yawut ya ne ko: «Du jëf ju baax lanu lay sànneey xeer, ba rey la, waaye dangaa diir Yàlla mbagg. Yaw ngay nit doŋŋ te naan yaay Yàlla!»<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa bindeesul ci seen téereb yoon, kàddug Yàlla gii: “Dama ne ay yàlla ngeen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 82.6.</note>”? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ndegam Yàlla moo woowe “yàlla” ñi kàddug Yàlla dikkal, te Mbindum kàddoom maneesu koo toxal, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />kon man mi Yàlla beral boppam, yebal ma ci àddina, ana nu ngeen ma mana waxe ne: “Yaa diir Yàlla mbagg,” ndax li ma ne maay <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Su ma deful sama liggéeyu Baay, buleen ma gëm; <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />waaye gannaaw moom laay def, su ngeen ma gëmul sax, gëmleen boog jëf ji, ngir ngeen xam te ràññee ne Baay baa ngi ci man, te man it, maa ngi ci Baay bi.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ñu di ko jéematee jàpp nag, mu far rëcc leen.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu jàllaat dexu Yurdan, daldi dem fa béreb ba <char style="w" lemma="Yaxya:">Yaxya</char> njëkkoon di sóobe nit ñi, mu dal foofa. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ñu bare nag dikk, fekk ko fa, te naan: «Yaxya de wonewul jenn firnde, waaye mboolem lu mu wax ci kii, dëgg la.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ñu bare gëme ko foofa.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci deewug Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Jenn waay a woppoon; ñu di ko wax Lasaar, di waa Betani, dëkkub Maryaama ak Màrt, ña mu bokkal ndey ak baay. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maryaama mooy ki sotti woon Sang bi lajkoloñ, ba fompe ay tànkam kawaru boppam. Moom la Lasaar mi woppoon di càmmiñam. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ñaari jigéeni Lasaar yooyu nag yónnee ca Yeesu ne ko: «Sang bi, sa soppe bi daa wopp.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yeesu dégg ca, ne: «Wopp jooju de du woppi dee, waaye darajay Yàlla lay feeñal, ba màggale ko <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> ji.»<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yeesu nag ku soppoon Màrt la, ak Maryaama ak Lasaar. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Teewul ba mu déggee ne daa wopp, toogaat na ñaari fan fa mu nekkoon. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Gannaaw loolu mu ne taalibe ya: «Nanu dellu Yude.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Taalibe ya ne ko: «Kilifa gi, yàggul dara la la fa waa Yude doon wuta sànniy doj ngir rey la, nga di fa dellu?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa du bëccëg fukki waxtook ñaar la? Kuy doxe bëccëg, du fakkastalu, ndax leeru àddina sii muy gis. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Waaye kuy doxe guddi, mooy fakkastalu, ndax ag leer la dul am.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Loolu la Yeesu wax, dal cay teg ne leen: «Sunu xarit Lasaar nelaw na, waaye maay dem ba yee ko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Taalibe ya ne ko: «Sang bi, su dee nelaw kay, dina mucc.»<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Li Yeesu waxe noonu mooy Lasaar dee na, ñoom nag ñu foog ne da ne Lasaar day nelaw rekk. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ca la leen Yeesu wax lu leer, ne leen: «Lasaar dee na. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Dee gi fekku ma fa, te loolu tax na maa bég ndax yeen, ngir dina tax ngeen gëm. Nanu ko seeti.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ci kaw loolu Tomaa mi ñuy wax Seex bi, ne bokki taalibeem: «Nanu dem nun itam, ngir ànd ak moom dee!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu mooy dekkal, di dundal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ba Yeesu agsee, fekk na Lasaar am ñeenti fan ci biir <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char>. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betani nag jegewoo na ak Yerusalem, te diggante bi yées na ñetti kilomet. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yawut yu baree dikkoon kër Màrt ak Maryaama, ngir dëfal leen ci seen deewug càmmiñ.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ba Màrt yégee ne Yeesoo ngay ñëw, da koo gatanduji, te fekk na Maryaama toog ca kër ga. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Màrt ne Yeesu: «Sang bi, soo fi nekkoon de, sama càmmiñ du dee. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Waaye ba léegi sax, xam naa ne loo ñaan Yàlla, Yàlla may la ko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yeesu ne ko: «Sa càmmiñ dina dekki.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Màrt ne ko: «Xam naa ne dina dekki kera ca ndekkitel bés bu mujj ba.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man maay ndekkite li, maay dund gi; ku ma gëm, soo deewee it, dinga dund. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Te képp kuy dund te gëm ma, doo dee mukk. Ndax gëm nga loolu?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Mu ne ko: «Waaw, Sang bi. Man gëm naa ne yaay <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, ki ñëw ci àddina si.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Loolu la Màrt wax, daldi woowi Maryaama, ñaarook moom, ne ko: «Kilifa gi ñëw na, ba di la laaj.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maryaama dégg loolu, gaaw jóg dem ca Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Booba Yeesu agseegul ca biir dëkk ba, waaye ma nga ba tey fa mu daje woon ak Màrt. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Yawut ya nekk ak Maryaama ca kër ga, di ko dëfal nag, gis ko na mu nee bërét génn, ñu topp ko, defe ne day jooyi ca bàmmeel ba.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ba Maryaama agsee ba gis Yeesu, da ne gurub cay tànkam ne ko: «Sang bi, soo fi nekkoon de, sama càmmiñ li du dee.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ba ko Yeesu gisee muy jooy, Yawut ya mu àndal itam di jooy, yaramam daw na, mu jàq. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Mu ne leen: «Fu ngeen ko denc?» Ñu ne ko: «Kaay gis, Sang bi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yeesu nag jooy. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yawut ya naan: «Gisleen rekk ni mu ko bëgge!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Teewul ñenn ca ñoom naan: «Moom mi muri bëti gumba gi, manul woona fexe itam ba kii du dee?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Naka la yaramu Yeesu dawati lool, mu dem ba ca bàmmeel ba, muy pax mu ñu yatt ciw doj, ube pax mi aw doj. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yeesu ne: «Dindileen doj wi!» Màrt, jigéenu ki dee ne ko: «Sang bi, fii nu tollu dina am xet, nde mu ngi ci ñeenti fanam.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yeesu ne ko: «Xanaa waxuma la ne soo gëmee, dinga gis màggug Yàlla?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ñu dindi doj wa. Yeesu xool ca kaw, daldi ne: «Baay, sant naa la, ndax nangul nga ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Man nag xam naa ne saa su nekk danga may nangul, waaye mbooloo mi fi teew a ma taxa wax loolu, ngir ñu gëm ne yaw yaa ma yebal.»<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Loolu la Yeesu wax, daldi xaacu ca kaw, ne: «Lasaar, génnal!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Néew bi génn ak càngaayam, tànk yeek loxo yi lëmëse, kanam ga muure. Yeesu ne leen: «Tekkileen ko, bàyyi ko mu dem.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yawut yi jógal nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Yawut yu bare ca ña ñëwoon kër Maryaama, ba ñu gisee la Yeesu def, ca lañu ko gëm. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Teewul ñenn ca ñoom dem ca <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya, ba nettali leen la Yeesu def. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" /><char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak Farisen ya woo <char style="w" lemma="kuréelu àttekat y-:">kuréelu àttekat</char> ya, ne leen: «Ana lu nuy def nag? Ndax nit kii kat a ngi def firnde yu bare! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Su nu ko bàyyee nii, ñépp a koy gëm, te kon kilifay Room dikk boole sunu béreb bu sell bi ak sunuw xeet, tas!»<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Kenn ca ñoom nag ku ñuy wax Kayif te doon sarxalkat bu mag ba ca at mooma, ne leen: «Yeen, dangeena xamul dara. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Yeen gisuleen sax ne seen njariñ moo di kenn nit doŋŋ deewal ñépp, ba askan wépp baña bokk sànku.»<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Loolu du lu Kayif wax ci sagoom, la mu doon sarxalkat bu mag ca at mooma, moo ko taxa jottali kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char> yooyu mu biral, ne Yeesu mooy deewal xeet wi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Te du xeet woowu doŋŋ la ko defal, waaye da koo def ngir itam dajale doomi Yàlla yi tasaaroo, ñu doon benn bopp.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Bésub keroog nag la njiiti Yawut yi dogu ci rey Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ci kaw loolu Yeesu jaareetul fu ñu koy gise ca Yawut ña, waaye fa la bàyyikoo, dem gox ba feggook màndiŋ ma, ca dëkk ba ñuy wax Efrayim. Foofa la toog aki taalibeem.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">Bésub Mucc</char> nag moo jubsi woon, di màggalu Yawut yi. Ci biir loolu ñu bare jóge ca dëkki kaw ga, jëm Yerusalem balaa bésu Mucc baa dikk, ngir setluji fa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ba mu ko defee ñuy seet Yeesu. Naka lañu taxaw ca kër Yàlla ga, di wax ca seen biir, naan: «Lu ngeen ci xalaat? Da dul ñëw ci màggal gi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ci biir loolu sarxalkat yu mag ya ak Farisen ya joxe ndigal ne képp ku xam fu Yeesu nekk, na ko xamle, ngir ñu jàpp ko.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Maryaama teral na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ba <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char> desee juróom benni fan, ca la Yeesu dikk ba Betani, dëkkub Lasaar ma mu dekkal. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ñu toggal fa Yeesu ab reer. Màrt moo taaj, Lasaar di kenn ca ña bokk ak Yeesu ndab. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maryaama nag indi genn wàllu liitaru nàrd, diwu nàrd gu xeeñ lu neex te raxul te jafe njëg lool, sotti ko ca tànki Yeesu, daldi fomp tànk ya ak kawaru boppam. Kër ga gépp ne bann ak xetu diw ga. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Teewul Yuda Iskaryo miy kenn ci taalibeem te doon ko waaja wor, daldi ne: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Ana lu waral jaayeesul lajkoloñ jii lu tollook ñetti téeméeri poseti xaalis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">poseti xaalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy peyooru benn bésub liggéey ca jamono yooya.</char></note>, ngir jox ko néew-doole yi?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ba Yuda Iskaryo di wax loolu nag, du néew-doole yi lay xalaat, waaye ab sàcc la woon; dencub taalibe ya la yoroon, di yulli lu ñu ca def.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Teewul Yeesu ne ko: «Bàyyil Maryaama! Bés ba ñu may rob la fàggul lajkoloñ jii. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Néew-doole yi, dingeen ci am ñu nekk ak yeen ba fàww, waaye man amuleen ma ba fàww.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mbooloom Yawut mu réy a dikk ba ñu yégee ne Yeesoo nga fa, te Yeesu rekk yóbbuwu leen fa, waaye dañoo bëggoona gisaale Lasaar ma Yeesu dekkaloon. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" /><char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya nag dogu, nara rey Lasaar itam, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ndax moo waraloon Yawut yu bare dem, dëddu leen, gëm Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dugg na Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ca ëllëg sa mbooloo mu bare ma dikk ca <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char> ba ca Yerusalem, dañoo yég ne Yeesoo ngay ñëw. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ñu jël cari garab yu ñu koy lalal, daldi génn gatanduji ko. Ña ngay xaacu naan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«<char style="w" lemma="Osaana:">Osaana</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Na barke wàcc ci ki dikk ci turu Boroom bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">na barke wàcc ci buurub Israayil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 118.25-26.</note>!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yeesu waajal ag cumbur, war ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">cumbur: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ci jamonoy jàmm, jamono yu xeex amul woon, buur yi daan nañu war mbaam, te doonul lu leen di tuutal.</char></note>, noonu ñu ko binde woon, ne:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Janq <char style="w" lemma="Siyoŋ:">Siyoŋ</char> mu taaru, bul tiit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Niiral, sa buur a la dikkal nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">am cumbur la war<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 9.9.</note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Kàddu yooyu nag, taalibe ya xamuñu woon ca saa sa lu muy tekki, waaye ba Yeesu tàbbee ca darajaam, ca lañu fàttaliku ne loolu lañu bindoon ci moom, te loolu it lañu ko defal.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Mbooloo ma daroon Yeesu, ba muy woo Lasaar, ba dekkal ko nag, di nettali la ñu fekke. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Moo tax itam mbooloo ma gatandu ko, ndax yégoon nañu ne googu kéemaan la def. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" /><char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yi nag di waxante ci seen biir naan: «Xoolleen, dara ngeen ci manul; àddina yépp a ko topp!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu yégle na ag deewam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ca mbooloo ma dikkoon jaamusi Yàlla ca Yerusalem ca màggal ga, ay Gereg ña nga ca woon. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ñooñoo dikk ba ca Filib ma dëkke Betsayda ca diiwaanu Galile, ne ko: «Sang bi, danoo bëgga gis Yeesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filib dem wax ko Àndre; Àndre ak Filib waxi ko Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yeesu wax leen ne leen: «Waxtu wi ñu wara darajaal <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki jot na. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, su feppu bele waddul ci suuf, dee, wéetaay lay dëkke. Waaye su deewee lay meññ fepp yu bare. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Képp ku bëgg bakkanam moo koy ñàkk; waaye ku bañ bakkanam ci àddina sii, moo musal bakkanam ba keroog muy texe ba fàww. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ku may surgawu, na ma topp; fu ma nekk, sama surga ne fa moom itam. Ku ma surgawu nag, sama Baay moo koy teral.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Léegi nag am naa njàqarey xol. Ana lu may wax? Dama naa: “Baay, musal ma ci coonob waxtu wii”? Waaye coonob waxtu wii tembe moo ma taxa dikk! <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Baay, màggalal saw tur!» Ci kaw loolu baat dégtu ci asamaan, ne: «Maa koy màggal, màggalati ko.»<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mbooloo ma fa taxaw te dégg baat ba nag ne: «Yàlla jee dënu!» Ñeneen ña ne: «Am malaaka moo wax ak moom.» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Teewul Yeesu ne leen: «Baat boobu du maa tax mu jib, waaye yeena tax. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Léegi nag àtteb àddina sii jot na; léegi lees di dàq ca biti kàngam li jiite àddina sii. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Man nag kera bu ñu ma yékkatee, jële ma fi kaw suuf, ñépp laay xëcc, jëme ci man.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Kàddu yooyu la misaale deewin wa mu naroona deewe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mbooloo ma ne ko: «Nun danoo dégge ci téereb yoonu Musaa bi ne <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi day sax ba fàww. Kon yaw, noo mane ne: “Fàww dees na yékkati Doomu nit ki?” Doomu nit kooku mooy kan sax?»<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yeesu ne leen: «Leer gaa ngeegum ci seen biir ci diggante bu gàtt. Doxleen ci bi ngeen di am leer, ngir lëndëm bañ leena bett. Kuy doxe ag lëndëm, xamoo foo jëm. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Gëmleen ko ci bi ngeen di am leer, ngir ngeen doon doomi leer.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Yeesu bërgël na Yawut ya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Loolu la Yeesu wax, daldi dem làquji leen. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Firnde yu bare la def ci seen kanam te taxul ñu gëm ko, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />te noonu la kàddug Yonent Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="Esayi:">Esayi</char> sottee. Mooy ba mu nee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Boroom bi, ana ku gëm sunub dégtal?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Dooley loxol Boroom bi, ana ku mu ko won<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 53.1.</note>?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Manuñu woona gëm it, ndax Esayee neeti:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Yàllaa gumbaal seeni gët,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">tëj seenum xel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ngir seeni gët du gis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">seenum xel du xam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ngir ñu baña dëpp, ba ma wéral leen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 6.10.</note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Loolu Esayee ko wax, ndax moo gisoon darajay Yeesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Esayi</char> 6.1 </note>, bay wax ci mbiram.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Teewul sax ñu bare ci njiiti Yawut yi gëmoon nañu Yeesu, waaye <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> yee taxoon biraluñu seen ngëm, ndax ragal ñu dàqe leen ca jàngu Yawut ba, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />ndax ngërëmal nit ñi moo leen gënaloon ngërëmal Yàlla.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yeesu nag àddu ca kaw ne: «Ku ma gëm, du man nga gëm, waaye ki ma yónni nga gëm, <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />te ku ma gis, gis nga ki ma yónni. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Man maa dikk, di ag leer ci àddina, ngir ku ma gëm du des cig lëndëm. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ku dégg samay wax te toppu ko, du man maa koy daan, ndax daan àddina taxu maa dikk, waaye musal àddinaa ma taxa dikk. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ku ma xarab ba nanguwul samay wax, am na ab daan-katam: kàddu gi ma wax moo koy daan, keroog bés bu mujj ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ndax kat du ci sama coobarey bopp laay waxe, waaye Baay bi ma yónni, moom ci boppam moo ma sant li may dégtale ak li may wax. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Te xam naa ne ab santaaneem moo dig texe gu sax dàkk. Moo tax it, li may wax man, ni ma ko Baay bi dégtale, ni laa koy waxe.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu raxas na tànki taalibeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Balaa <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char> baa dikk, Yeesu xamoon na ne waxtu wa muy bàyyikoo àddina, jëm fa Baay ba, jot na. Cofeelu Yeesu ak ñoñam ñi ci àddina, googu cofeel la leen sopp ba ca muj ga.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Ba Yeesu di bokk reer ak taalibe ya, fekk na <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> xiirtal Yuda, doomu Simoŋ Iskaryo, ci wor Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yeesu xamoon na ne lépp la Baay bi teg ciy loxoom, te it ci Yàlla la jóge, te ci Yàlla la jëm. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Mu jóge nag ca ndabal reer ba, summi mbubbam mu mag, daldi jël am malaan, laxasaayoo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Gannaaw loolu mu sotti ndox cib këll, daldi tàmbalee raxas tànki taalibe ya, di fompe sér ba mu laxasaayoo.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ba mu agsee ba ca Simoŋ Piyeer, Piyeer ne ko: «Sang bi, yaw yaa may raxasal samay tànk?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man li may def nii tey, xamuloo ko; waaye ëllëg dinga ko xam.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piyeer ne ko: «Déedéet, doo ma raxasal samay tànk mukk kay!» Yeesu ne ko: «Su ma la raxasalul, doo am ci man benn cér.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoŋ Piyeer ne ko: «Kon nag Sang bi, bumu doon samay tànk doŋŋ, waaye na ci loxo yeek bopp bi bokk far!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ku sangu ba noppi, soxlaatula raxas lu moy ay tànkam, ndax set na wecc. Yeen nag set ngeen, waaye du ñépp.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Booba Yeesu xam na ka koy wor, te looloo tax mu ne: «Du yeen ñépp a set.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Gannaaw ba leen Yeesu raxasalee seeni tànk, teg ca solaat mbubbam, ba toogaat, da leen ne: «Xam ngeen li ma leen defal? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Yeena ngi ma naa Kilifa gi ak Sang bi, te yeena yey, nde moom laa. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ndegam nag man miy Sang bi, di Kilifa gi maa leen raxasal seeni tànk, kon yeen itam war ngeen di raxasalante ay tànk. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ab misaalu royukaay laa leen jox, ngir ni ma leen defal, ngeen di ko def yeen itam. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, jaam sutul sangam, te ndaw sutul ka ko yónni. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Loolu, su ngeen ko xamee, ndokkalee yeen, ndegam yeena ngi koy jëfe.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu weer na Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«Du yeen ñépp a tax may wax; man xam naa ñi ma tànn. Waaye Mbind mii fàww mu sotti: “Ki lekk samaw ñam moo ma wéq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 41.10.</note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Léegi laa leen koy dale wax, bala looloo dikk, ngir bu dikkee ngeen gëm ne maay Ki nekk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">maay Ki nekk: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci 8.24.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Maa leen ko wax déy, ci lu wér, ku dalal nit ku ma yónni, man nga dalal; te ku ma dalal, dalal nga ki ma yónni.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Loolu la Yeesu wax ba noppi, njàqare dikkal ko, mu daldi biral ne: «Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, kenn ci yeen moo may wor.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Taalibe ya di xoolante, te xamuñu kan lay wax. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Booba kenn ca taalibe ya, di ku Yeesu soppoon, ma nga sóonu, sës rëkk ca Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Kooku la Simoŋ Piyeer liyaar, ngir mu laaj Yeesu ka ko taxoon di wax. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Kooku sóonu ba tafu ca dënnub Yeesu, ne ko: «Sang bi, kooku kan la?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yeesu ne ko: «Mooy ki may jox, man ci sama bopp, dogu mburu bi may capp ci ndab li.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:26">Yeesu nag jël dogu mburu, capp ko ca ndab la, jox ko Yuda, doomu Simoŋ Iskaryo. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Naka la Yuda jël dog ba, <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char> man ko. Yeesu ne ko: «Li ngay def, gaaw ci boog!»<verse eid="JHN 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Loolu nag kenn ca ña woon ca ndab la xamul lu tax mu wax ko ko. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ñenn ña dañoo xalaat ne gannaaw Yuda moo yoroon dencub taalibe ya, Yeesu da koo wax ne ko, mu gaaw jëndi lu ñu waajale màggal gi, mbaa néew-doole yi la ko ne mu dem saraxi leen. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ba mu ko defee Yuda jël dogu mburu ba, daldi génn ca saa sa. Booba nag guddi na.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu nee, Piyeer dina jàmbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ba Yuda génnee, Yeesu da ne: «Léegi nag darajay <char style="w" lemma="Doomu nit k-:">Doomu nit</char> ki feeñ na, te darajay Yàllaa ngi feeñe ci moom. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Te ni darajay Yàlla feeñe ci Doomu nit ki, ni la Yàlla di feeñale ci boppam darajay Doomu nit ki, te dina ko def léegi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Gone yi, diir bu gàtt laa deeti nekk ak yeen. Dingeen ma seet, waaye li ma wax Yawut yi rekk: “Man, fa ma jëm, yeen dungeen fa mana dem.” <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Kon ndigal lu bees laa leen di jox, soppanteleen: ni ma leen soppe, yeen itam nangeen ni soppantee. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ni ñépp di xame ne samay taalibe ngeen moo di ngeen soppante.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoŋ Piyeer ne ko: «Sang bi, foo jëm?» Yeesu ne ko: «Fa ma jëm, doo ma fa mana topp léegi, waaye dinga ma toppsi ca kanam.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Piyeer ne ko: «Sang bi, lu tee ma man laa topp léegi? Sama bakkan laa la àttana joxeel!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yeesu ne ko: «Sa bakkan nga ma àttana joxeel? Maa la ko wax déy ci lu wér, bala ganaar a sab, dinga ma jàmbu ñetti yoon.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dëfal na taalibe ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />«Buleen jàq. Gëmleen Yàlla te gëm ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Sama kër Baay, dëkkuwaay yu baree nga fa. Su demewul woon noonu, ndax dinaa leen ne maa ngi leen fay waajali béreb? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Te gannaaw bu ma leen waajalee béreb, dinaa délsi, jëlsi leen, yóbbu, ba fu ma nekk, man, ngeen nekk fa, yeen itam. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Te fa ma jëm, xam ngeen yoon wi.» <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomaa ne ko: «Sang bi, xamunu foo jëm, kon ana nu nuy xame yoon wi?»<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu mooy yoon wi jëm ci Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man maay yoon wi, maay dëgg gi, te maay dund gi. Kenn du ñëw ci Baay bi te jaarewul ci man. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Su ngeen ma xamoon, sama Baay itam, dingeen ko xam. Li ko dale tey nag, xam ngeen ko, gis ngeen ko.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filib ne ko: «Sang bi, won nu Baay bi rekk, mu doy nu.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yeesu ne ko: «Filib, ni ma yàggeek yeen te ba tey xamuloo ma? Ku ma gis kay, gis nga Baay bi. Kon ana noo naan: “Won nu Baay bi”? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Dangaa gëmul ne man, maa ngi ci Baay bi, te Baay baa ngi ci man? Kàddu yi ma leen di wax, waxuma ko ci sama coobarey bopp, waaye Baay bi nekk ci man, moo sottal ay jëfam. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Gëmleen ma, ndax kàddu gii ma ne, maa ngi ci Baay bi, te Baay baa ngi ci man; mbaa boog, ngeen gëm ndax jëf ji may def. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, ku ma gëm, jëf ji may def man, moom itam dina ko def, te jëf ju raw jii sax lay def, ndax man, ci Baay bi laa jëm. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Te lépp lu ngeen ñaan ci sama tur, loolu laay def, ngir Doom ji fésal darajay Baay bi. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Su ngeen ma ñaanee mbir ci sama tur, man maa koy def.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dige na Noo gu Sell gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Su ngeen ma soppee, sàmmleen samay ndigal. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Man maay ñaan Baay bi, mu yónnee leen beneen Taxawukat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Taxawukat: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu nee, Taxawukat bi ag noo la, kon bët du ko gis. Gannaaw bi Yeesu yéegee asamaan ba bésu Pàntakot dikk, ca la Taxawukat bi wàcc ci taalibey Yeesu. Ba tey itam, képp kuy taalibeb Yeesu, ci sa xol la Taxawukat biy dëkk.</char></note>, ngir mu nekk ak yeen ba fàww. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Kooku mooy <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug Yàlla</char> giy xamle liy dëgg. Àddina du ko mana dalal, ndax gisu ko te xamu ko. Yeen nag xam ngeen ko, ndax ci seen biir la dëkk, te ci seen biir xel lay nekk. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Duma leen bàyyi ngeen tumurànke. Dinaa délsi ci yeen. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Des na tuuti, àddina du ma gisati; yeen dingeen ma gis, ndax man maa ngi dund, te yeen itam dingeen dund. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Bésub keroog dingeen xam ne man maa ngi ci sama Baay, yeen ngeen nekk ci man, man it ma nekk ci yeen. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Ki nangu sama ndigal nag, te di ko sàmm, moo ma sopp, te kooku ma sopp, cofeel ñeel na ko, bawoo fa sama Baay, te man itam dinaa ko sopp, di ko feeñu.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda meneen ma wuuteek Yuda Iskaryo, ne ko: «Sang bi, lu waral nga nar noo feeñu te doo feeñu àddina?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ku ma sopp day sàmm sama kàddu, sama Baay sopp ko; fi moom lanuy dikk, te moom lanuy def màkkaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ku ma soppul, du sàmm samay kàddu. Kàddu gi ngeen dégg nag, du sama gos, waaye kàddug Baay bi ma yónni la.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«Lii laa leen di wax bi may nekkagum ak yeen. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Waaye Taxawukat bi, di Noo gu Sell gi leen Baay biy yónnee ci sama tur, moo leen di jàngal lépp, fàttali leen lépp lu ma leen waxoon, man. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Jàmm laa leen bàyyee, sama jàmm laa leen may te mayuma leen ko ni àddina di mayee. Buleen jaaxle, buleen tiit.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />«Dégg ngeen ma ne leen: “Maa ngi dem, maa ngi délsi ci yeen.” Su ngeen ma soppoon, dingeen bége li may dem ci Baay bi, ndax Baay bee ma gëna màgg. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Léegi bala looloo dikk nag laa leen koy wax, ngir bu dikkee ngeen gëm. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Duma waxateek yeen lu bare ndax kàngamu àddinaa ngi dikk. Manul ci man dara nag. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Waaye fàww àddina xam ne Baay bi laa sopp, te li ma Baay bi sant rekk laay def. Jógleen, nu dem!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu mooy reseñ gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Man maay reseñ gi dëgg, sama Baay di boroom tóokër bi koy toppatoo. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Sama bépp car bu meññul, da koy tenqi sànni, bépp car bu ci meññ lay xosat ba mu set wecc, ngir mu gëna meññ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Yeen nag, set ngeen wecc ba noppi, ndax kàddu gi ma leen wax. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Saxleen ci man, ni ma saxe man ci sama bopp ci yeen. Ni carub reseñ tëlee meññal boppam, su saxul ci ndeyam, ni ngeen di tëlee meññ, su ngeen saxul ci man.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />«Man maay reseñ gi, yeen ngeen di car yi. Ki sax ci man, ma sax ci moom, kooku mooy meññ lu bare, nde su dul man, dungeen mana def dara. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ku saxul ci man daa mel ni ab car bu ñu sànni, mu wow, te yooyu car lees di buub, sànni ci sawara, mu lakk. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Su ngeen saxee ci man te samay wax sax ci yeen, lu ngeen bëgg, ñaanleen ko, dees na leen ko nangul. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Li feeñal sama darajay Baay mooy ngeen meññ lu bare, te noonu ngeen di firndeele ne samay taalibe ngeen.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />«Ni ma Baay bi soppe, man itam noonu laa leen soppe. Saxleen ci sama cofeel. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ni ma sàmme sama santaaney Baay, ba tax ma sax ci cofeelam, su ngeen ni sàmmee samay santaane, dingeen sax ci sama cofeel. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Maa leen wax loolu ngir samag mbég wàllsi ci yeen, ba seen mbég mat sëkk. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Sama santaane moo di ni ma leen soppe, ngeen soppantee noonu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Joxe sa bakkan te say xarit tax, ameesul cofeel gu ko raw, <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />te samay xarit ngeen, ndegam yeena ngi def li ma leen sant. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Wooweetuma leen ay jaam, ndax ab jaam xamul lu sangam di def. Xarit laa leen woowe, ndax mboolem lu ma dégge ci sama Baay, xamal naa leen ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Du yeen yeena ma tànn, man maa leen tànn, sas leen ngir ngeen dem, meññi meññeef, te seenum meññeef sax, ba lu ngeen ñaan Baay bi ci sama tur, mu may leen ko. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Li ma leen sant nag, moo di ngeen soppante.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku bañ Yeesu, bañ ab taalibeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Su leen àddina bañee, xamleen ne man la njëkka bañ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Su ngeen bokkoon ci àddina, àddina bëgg leen, ndax li ngeen diy ñoñam, waaye dangeena bokkul ci àddina, nde maa leen tànne ci àddina, te looloo tax àddina bañ leen. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Fàttalikuleen kàddu gi ma leen wax: “Jaam sutul sangam.” Gannaaw man lañu bunduxataal, yeen itam, dinañu leen bunduxataal. Bu ñu sàmmoon sama kàddu, dinañu sàmm seen gos itam. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Waaye mboolem lu ñu ma def, dinañu leen ko def ndax sama tur, ndax xamuñu ki ma yónni. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Su ma ñëwul woon, ba wax ak ñoom, duñu am bàkkaar. Waaye léegi amuñu aw lay ci seeni bàkkaar. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Ku ma bañ nag, bañ nga sama Baay itam. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Su ma deful woon ci seen biir jëf yu kenn deful, kon duñu am bàkkaar. Léegi nag gis nañu ko, te teewul ñu bañ ma, bañ sama Baay. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Waaye loolu moo am, ngir sottal kàddu gii binde ci seen téereb yoon: “Dañu maa bañ ci dara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 69.5.</note>.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Taxawukat bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.26 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Taxawukat bi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci 14.16-17, 26.</char></note> may yónni ci yeen te muy jóge ci Baay bi mooy <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug dëgg</char> googu di bàyyikoo ci Baay bi, te kooku bu dikkee, moo may seedeel. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Te yeen itam dingeen seede, ndax ca njàlbéen ngeen dale nekk ak man.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Loolu laa leen di wax, ngir seen ngëm baña wàññiku. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Dees na leen dàqe ci jàngu Yawut ya, te sax waxtoo ngi ñëw wu képp ku leen bóom yaakaar ne Yàlla la koy jaamoo. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Loolu, li waral ñu di ko def moo di dañoo xamul Baay bi, xamuñu ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ma wax leen loolu, ngir bu waxtu wi dikkee, ngeen fàttaliku ne man, waxoon naa leen ko. Waaye loolu nag, waxuma leen ko woon ca njàlbéen, ndax maa ngi nekkagum ak yeen.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taxawukat bi am na sasam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />«Léegi nag maa ngi dem ca ka ma yónni, te kenn ci yeen laaju ma fu ma jëm. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Waaye aw tiis a fees seen xol ndax li ma leen wax. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Moona man de, dëgg laa leen wax. Seen njariñ moo di ma dem, ndax su ma demul, Taxawukat bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Taxawukat bi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci 14.16-17, 26.</char></note> du ñëw ci yeen; waaye su ma demee, maa leen koy yónnee. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Te bu dikkee, mooy tiiñal àddina ci wàllu bàkkaar ak ci wàllu dëgg ak ci wàllu àtte. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Benn, ci wàllu bàkkaar, ndax ñoo ma gëmul. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Ñaar, ci wàllu dëgg, ndax maa ngi dem ci Baay bi, te dungeen ma gisati. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Ñett, ci wàllu àtte, ndax àttees na kàngamu àddina sii, ba daan ko.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Am naa ba tey lu bare lu ma leen wara wax, waaye dungeen ko mana àttan léegi. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Moom miy <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noowug dëgg</char> gi, bu dikkee, moo leen di àggale ci dëgg gi gépp, ndax du ci coobarey boppam lay wax, waaye mboolem lu mu dégg la leen di wax, te liy ñëw ëllëg, moo leen koy wax. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Moom, dina feeñal sama daraja, ndax ci sama jagleb bopp lay tanqe, àgge leen ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Mboolem lu Baay bi am, maay boroom. Moo tax ma ne ci sama jagleb bopp lay tanqe, àgge leen ko.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiisu gëmkat tey, bànneexam ëllëg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Fi leek ab diir, dungeen ma gisati; waaye gannaaw ab diirati, dingeen ma gisaat.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ñenn ca taalibe ya di wax ca seen biir naan: «Li mu nuy wax nii, lu mu doon? Mu ne: “Fi leek ab diir, dungeen ma gisati, waaye gannaaw ab diirati, dingeen ma gisaat,” ak “ndax maa ngi dem ca Baay ba.”» <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ña nga naan: «Lii mu wax lu mu doon? Mu ne “Gannaaw ab diirati.” Xamunu lu mu wax de.»<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yeesu nag gis li ñu ko bëgga laaj, mu ne leen: «Lii ma wax ngeen di laaj ci seen biir: “Fi leek ab diir, dungeen ma gisati, gannaaw ab diirati, ngeen gisaat ma”? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, yeen yeenay jooy aka jooytu, àddina moom di bég; yeen, yeenay amu tiis, waaye bànneex la seenu tiis di soppaliku. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Kuy waaja wasin, dina amu tiis, ndax waxtuw matam a jot. Waaye bu doom ji juddoo, dootul fàttaliku njàqareem, ndax ki gane àddina lay bége. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Kon yeen itam, tey, aw tiis ngeen am, waaye dinaa leen gisaat, seen xol sedd, te seen mbég moomu, kenn du leen ko xañ. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Bésub keroog, man dootuleen ma ñaan dara. Maa leen ko wax déy ci lu wér, su boobaa lu ngeen ñaan Baay bi ci sama tur, mu may leen ko. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ba léegi ñaanuleen dara ci sama tur. Ñaanleen, nangule, ngir seen mbég mat sëkk.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu daan na àddina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Loolu, ci ay misaal laa leen ko wax. Waxtoo ngi ñëw wu ma dootul wax ak yeen ci ay misaal, waaye ci Baay bi laa leen di wax lu leer nàññ. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Bésub keroog, ci sama tur ngeen di ñaan. Waxuma leen ne man maa leen di ñaanal Baay bi, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />ndax kat Baay bi ci boppam moo leen sopp, ndaxte yeena ma sopp, te gëm ngeen ne man, ci Yàlla laa jóge. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ci Baay bi laa jóge, dikk ci àddina, te léegi maa ngi jóge ci àddina, jëm ci Baay bi.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Taalibe yi ne ko: «Mu ngoog, lu leer nàññ ngay wax nii, te misaaloo! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Léegi xam nanu ne xam nga lépp, te soxlawoo ku la laaj dara, te looloo tax nu gëm ne ci Yàlla nga jóge.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yeesu ne leen: «Xanaa gëm ngeen léegi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Waxtoo ngii di ñëw te agsi na ba noppi, ca ngeen di tasaaroo, ku nekk ak yoonu boppam, bàyyi ma, ma wéet. Waaye duma wéet, ndax Baay bi moo nekk ak man. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Loolu dama leen koo wax ngir seen xel dal ci man. Àddina sii, dingeen fi am njàqare, waaye dëgërluleen, ndax daan naa àddina.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu sàkku na darajaam ja woon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Loolu la Yeesu wax ba noppi, téen, xool asamaan, daldi ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 17:1">«Baay, waxtu wi jot na. Feeñalal sa darajay Doom, ngir Doom ji feeñal sa daraja. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Yaa ko jox sañ-sañ ci ñépp, ngir mboolem ñi nga ko jox, mu texeel leen ba fàww. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Texeg fàww gi nag moo di ñu xam la, yaw jenn Yàlla jiy dëgg, xam it ki nga yebal, muy Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Man de, feeñal naa sa màggaay ci àddina; liggéey bi nga ma santoon ma def ko, sottal naa ko. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Léegi nag Baay, daraja ja ma amoon fa yaw, balaa àddinaa sosu, jox ma daraja jooju fa sa wet.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu ñaanal na ay taalibeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />«Nit ñi nga tànne ci àddina, jox ma leen, ràññeeloo naa leen saw tur. Sa ñoñ lañu woon, nga jox ma leen, te sa kàddu, sàmm nañu ko. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Léegi xam nañu ne lépp lu ma am ci yaw la jóge, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ndax wax ji nga ma dénk, dénk naa leen ko, te nangu nañu ko. Xam nañu xéll it ne ci yaw laa jóge, te gëm nañu ne yaw yaa ma yebal. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Man nag, ñoom laay ñaanal; ñaanaluma waa àddina, waaye ñi nga ma dénk, ñoom laay ñaanal, ndax sa ñoñ lañu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Mboolem lu ma am, yaa ko moom, te loo am, maa ko moom, te ci ñoom la sama daraja feeñe. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Toogatuma ci àddina, waaye ñoom ci àddina lañu nekk, te man, ci yaw laa jëm. Baay bu sell bi, sàmme leen sa tur wi nga ma jox, ngir ni nu nekke benn, ñoom it ñu nekke noonu benn. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Diir bi may nekk ak ñoom, man maa leen doon sàmme sa tur wi nga ma jox. Wattu naa leen, ba kenn ci ñoom sànkuwul, ku moy doomu sànkute<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">doomu sànkute ji, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda Iskaryo la.</char></note> jiy sànku, ngir Mbind mi sotti.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />«Léegi nag, ci yaw laa jëm, waaye lii laay wax bi may nekkagum ci àddina, ngir sama mbég ñeel leen, mat sëkk. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Man, jottali naa leen sa kàddu, waaye àddinaa leen bañ, ndax ni ma ñàkka bokke ci àddina, ni lañu ñàkka bokke ci àddina. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ñaanuma nga jële leen ci àddina, xanaa nga musal leen ci <char style="w" lemma="ku bon ki:">ku bon ki</char>. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ni ma ñàkka bokke ci àddina, man ci sama bopp, noonu lañu ñàkka bokke ci àddina. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ngalla sellale leen dëgg gi: sa kàddu mooy dëgg. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ni nga ma yebale ci àddina, man itam, ni laa leen yebale ci àddina. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Man nag, ñoom laa sellalal sama bopp, ngir ñoom itam, ñu mana sellaloo dëgg gi.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu ñaanal na ay gëmkatam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Du ñoom doŋŋ laay ñaanal nag, waaye ñi may gëm ëllëg ndax seen kàddu itam laay ñaanal, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />ngir ñépp doon benn, ni nga nekke yaw Baay, ci man, ma nekke ko ci yaw, ñoom itam, ñu nekke ni ci nun, ba àddina gëm ne yaw yaa ma yebal. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Man nag daraja ji nga ma jox, jox naa leen ko, ngir ni nu nekke benn maak yaw, ñu nekke ni noonu. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Man ma nekk ci ñoom, yaw nga nekk ci man, ngir ñu mat sëkk ci ag bennoo, ba àddina xam ne yaw yaa ma yebal, te ni nga ma soppe, ni nga leen soppe.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«Ñi nga ma jox nag, Baay, bëgg naa, fa may ne, ñoom it, ñu nekk faak man, ngir ñu gis sama daraja ji nga ma jox, ndax yaa ma sopp laata àddina di sosu.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />«Baay Boroom njub, àddinaa la xamul, waaye man xam naa la, te ñii xam nañu ne yaa ma yebal. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Xamal naa leen sa tur te dinaa ko gëna xamle, ngir cofeel gi nga ma sopp nekk ci ñoom, te man it, ma nekk ci ñoom.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Jàpp nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Loolu la Yeesu wax ba noppi, dem, ànd ak taalibeem ya, ñu jàlli ca wàllaa xuru Sedoron. Ab tool a nga fa woon nag, ñu daldi dugg ca biir. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda mi koy wor it xamoon na béreb ba, ndax Yeesu daan na fa farala ànd aki taalibeem. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ci kaw loolu Yuda jubal ca tool ba, ànd ak gàngooru takk-der aki wattukati kër Yàlla ga te ñu bàyyikoo ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Farisen y-:">Farisen</char> ya, yor ay jum aki làmp aki gànnaay.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yeesu ma xamoon mboolem la koy dikkal nag, génn, jubsi leen, ne leen: «Ku ngeen di seet?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ñu ne ko: «Yeesum Nasaret.» Mu ne: «Man a.» Yuda ma koy wor a nga bokk ak ñoom taxaw. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ba leen Yeesu nee: «Man a,» dañoo dellu gannaaw, ba daanu. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Mu dellu ne leen: «Ku ngeen di seet?» Ñu ne: «Yeesum Nasaret.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Mu ne leen: «Ne naa leen man la. Gannaaw man ngeen di seet nag, baleen ñii ma àndal, ñu dem.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Kàddu ga Yeesu noon Yàlla: «Ñi nga ma jox, kenn du ci sànku,» noonu la sottee.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Ci kaw loolu Simoŋ Piyeer ma ràngoo saamar, bocci, caw ko surgab sarxalkat bu mag ba, njoof noppu ndijoor ba. Surga ba, Malkus lañu koy wax. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yeesu ne Piyeer: «Defal saamar ci mbaram. Kaasub naqar bi ma Baay bi sédd, xanaa dama ko dul naan?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yóbbu nañu Yeesu ca Anas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ba loolu amee gàngooru takk-der ya ak seen <char style="w" lemma="njiitu gàngoor g-:">njiit</char>, ak wattukati kër Yàlla ga njiiti Yawut ya yilifoon, daldi jàpp Yeesu, yeew ko. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Ca Anas lañu ko njëkka yóbbu, ndax moo doon baayu jabaru Kayif ma doon <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, ca at mooma. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayif moomu moo digaloon Yawut ya ne leen: «Liy njariñ moo di kenn nit doŋŋ deewal askan wi.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer jàmbu na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoŋ Piyeer nag ànd ak keneen ca taalibe ya, ñu topp ca Yeesu. Fekk na beneen taalibe ba xamante ak <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, ba tax mu ànd ak Yeesu, dugg ca biir kër sarxalkat bu mag ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Teewul Piyeer, moom, taxaw ca bunt kër ga. Ci kaw loolu beneen taalibe ba xam sarxalkat bu mag ba daldi génn, wax ak surga bu jigéen bay wattu bunt ba, ba dugal Piyeer ca biir.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Surga bu jigéen bay wattu bunt kër ga ne Piyeer: «Yaw itam, bokkuloo ci taalibey waa jii?» Mu ne ko: «Bokkuma ci.»<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ci biir loolu surga ya ak wattukat ya taxaw, tiim ab taalu këriñ gu ñu boyal bay jaaru, ndax dafa seddoon. Piyeer itam taxaw faak ñoom, di jaaru.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarxalkat bu mag ba seetlu na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba daldi laaj Yeesu ci mbirum ay taalibeem ak ci am njàngaleem. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yeesu ne ko: «Man de, fàŋŋ laa waxe ak àddina. Te it man ca jàngu ba ak ca kër Yàlla ga, fa Yawut yépp di daje, fa laa mas di jàngalee, te làquwuma di wax lenn. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ana loo may laaje? Li ma wax, laaj ko ñi ma dégg. Ñoom kay xam nañu bu baax li ma wax, man.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ba Yeesu waxee loolu, kenn ca wattukati kër Yàlla ga fa taxawoon daldi ko dóor mbej, ne ko: «Ndax noonu ngay tontoo sarxalkat bu mag bi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yeesu ne ko: «Su ma waxee ndëngte, seedeel lu ci dëng, te su dee njub laa wax, ana loo may dóore?»<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ba loolu amee Anas jàllale ko, na ñu ko yeewe, ca Kayif, sarxalkat bu mag ba.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piyeer jàmbooti na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ci biir loolu Simoŋ Piyeer a nga taxaw, di jaaru ba tey. Ñu ne ko: «Yaw itam du ci taalibey waa ji nga bokk?» Piyeer miim ko, ne: «Bokkuma ci de.»<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Kenn ca surgay <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba, te di mbokkum ka Piyeer njoofoon noppam, ne Piyeer: «Xanaa du yaw laa gisoon ak moom ca tool ba?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Piyeer miimati ko. Ca saa sa nag ganaar sab.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu dem na kër Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ba loolu wéyee ñu jële Yeesu ca Kayif, yóbbu ko ca kër boroom réew ma. Waxtuw njël la woon; Yawut ñi ci seen bopp dugguñu ca biir kër ga, ndax baña sobeel seen bopp ba duñu mana lekk ca reeru <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">bésub Mucc</char> ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" /><char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> boroom réew ma moo génn, dajeek ñoom. Mu ne leen: «Ana lu ngeen di jiiñ waa jii?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Ñu ne ko: «Kii bu deful woon lu bon, duñu la ko jébbal.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilaat ne leen: «Jëlleen ko, yeen, te àtte ko ci seen yoonu bopp.» Yawut ya ne ko: «Nun, mayeesu nu nu teg kenn àtteb dee.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Kàddug Yeesu ga mu tegtale woon deewin wa mu nara deewe, noonu la sottee.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Gannaaw loolu Pilaat duggaat ca kër ga, daldi woo Yeesu, ne ko: «Yaw yaa di buurub Yawut yi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yeesu ne ko: «Loolu ndax yaw yaa ko waxal sa bopp, am ñeneen a la ko wax ci man?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilaat ne ko: «Ndax man dama dib Yawut? Saw xeetu bopp ak seeni <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag kay ñoo ma la jébbal. Ana loo def?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yeesu ne ko: «Sama nguur moo bokkul ci àddina sii. Bu sama nguur bokkoon ci àddina, samay surga xeex, ba kenn du ma jébbal njiiti Yawut yi. Waaye sama nguur a bokkul fii.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilaat ne ko: «Kon yaw buur nga?» Yeesu ne ko: «Yaa ko wax; buur laa. Li tax ma juddu, li tax ma dikk ci àddina moo di seedeel dëgg. Ku bokk ci dëgg gi nag dina dégg li ma wax.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilaat ne ko: «Ana luy dëgg gi?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Loolu la Pilaat wax, daldi génnaat ba ca Yawut ya, ne leen: «Man de gisuma ci moom lenn lees koy daane. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Gannaaw dangeena aadawoo nag ma bàyyil leen kenn nit ci bésub Mucc, ndax bëgg ngeen ma bàyyil leen kii di “buurub Yawut yi”?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ñu yuuxooti: «Du kii de, xanaa Barabas!» Te Barabas moomu doonoon ab fippukat.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Teg nañu Yeesu àtteb dee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ba mu ko defee <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> dóorlu Yeesu ay yar. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Takk-der ya teg ci boppu Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="kaala g-:">kaala</char> gu ñu ràbbe ay dég, solal ko mbubb mu xonq curr. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ñu dikk ba ca moom nag, naan ko: «Buuru Yawut yée, guddaluw fan!» te di ko dóori mbej.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Ci kaw loolu Pilaat génnati ne leen: «Ma ne, maa ngi leen koy indil ci biti, ngir ngeen xam ne gisuma ci moom lenn lees koy daane.»<verse eid="JHN 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yeesu nag génn ak kaalag dég gaak mbubb mu xonq ma. Pilaat ne leen: «Waa jaa ngii!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Teewul ba ko <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yu mag yaak wattukati kër Yàlla ga gisee, dañoo xaacoondoo, ne: «Daaj ko ci bant! Daaj ko ci bant!» Pilaat ne leen: «Jëlleen ko, yeen, daaj ko ci bant, ndax man gisuma ci moom lenn lees koy daane.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yawut yi ne ko: «Nun danoo am aw yoon, te ci sunuw yoon, àtteb dee moo war ci moom, ndax <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char> la teg boppam.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ba Pilaat déggee kàddu googu, tiitaangeem yokk. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Mu dellooti Yeesu ca biir kër ga, ne ko: «Yaw foo jóge?» Yeesu tontuwu ko. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilaat ne ko: «Man nga dul waxal? Xamuloo ne am naa sañ-sañu bàyyi la, am naa itam sañ-sañu daaj la ci bant?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yeesu ne ko: «Su dul woon ag may gu la dikke fa kaw, doo am benn sañ-sañ ci man. Moo tax it ki ma teg ci say loxo gënati laa bàkkaar.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Ca la Pilaat doxe di seet nu mu bàyyee Yeesu. Teewul Yawut ya xaacu ne: «Kii, soo ko bàyyee, doo xaritub buur <char style="w" lemma="Sesaar:">Sesaar</char>. Képp ku teg boppam buur, yaa noonoo buur Sesaar!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Naka la Pilaat dégg kàddu googu, daldi génne Yeesu, dem nag toog ca jalub àttekaay ba, fa ñuy wax Dër ba, te ñu naan ko Gabata ci làkku yawut. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Looloo nga yemook waxtuw digg bëccëg. Boobu ñu ngi waajal <char style="w" lemma="Màggal yi:">màggalu bésub Mucc</char> ba. Pilaat nag ne Yawut ya: «Seen buur a ngoogu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ñu yuuxoo: «Na dee! Na dee! Daaj ko ci bant!» Pilaat ne leen: «Ndax seen buur laay daaj ci bant?» Sarxalkat yu mag ya ne ko: «Amunu buur bu dul Sesaar!» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Noonu nag Pilaat teg Yeesu ci seeni loxo, ngir ñu daaj ko ci bant.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Daaj nañu Yeesu ci bant</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ñu daldi yóbbu Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Moom ci boppam moo gàddu bant ba, génn jëm ba fa ñuy wax bérebu Kaaŋu bopp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">bérebu Kaaŋu bopp </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy tund wu nirook kaaŋu bopp.</char></note>, muy firi Golgota ci làkku yawut. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Foofa lañu daaje Yeesu ca bant ba, mook ñeneen ñaar; kii ci wet gii, kee ca wet gee, Yeesu ca digg ba.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> bindlu itam ab tegtalukaay, we ko ca kaw bant ba ñu ko daaj, ñu bind ca lii: «Kii mooy Yeesum Nasaret, buurub Yawut yi.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Mbind moomu Yawut yu bare jàng nañu ko, ndax béreb ba ñu daaj Yeesu jege na dëkk ba, te ci yawut, ak ci làkku waa Room ak ci gereg lañu ko bind. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" /><char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">Sarxalkat</char> yu mag yu Yawut ya nag ne Pilaat: «Waruloo bind ne: “Kii mooy buurub Yawut yi,” li nga wara bind mooy: “Kii moo ne mooy buurub Yawut yi.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilaat ne leen: «Li ma bind, bind naa ko ba noppi.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Gannaaw ba ñu daajee Yeesu ca bant ba, takk-der ya dañoo jël ay yéreem, def ko ñeenti cér, takk-der bu nekk benn. Jël nañu itam mbubbam rabalam mu mag, di lenn ndimo te ñaweesu ko fenn ca kaw ba ca suuf. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Takk-der ya diisoo ca, ne: «Mbubb mi, bunu ko xotti, nanu ko tegoo bant, ngir xam ku koy moom.» Noonu la mbir ma tëdde, ngir Mbind ma indi woon lii, sotti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Séddoo nañu samay yére,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">sama mbubb mu mag, ñu tegoo ko bant<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 22.19.</note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Loolu nag la takk-der ya def.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ña taxawoon ca wetu bant ba ñu daaj Yeesu, ñoo di yaayam ak yaayam ju ndaw, ak Maryaama jabaru Këlopas, ak Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Taalibe ba Yeesu soppoon itam ma nga fa woon, taxaw. Ba leen Yeesu gisee da ne yaayam: «Soxna si, sa doom a ngoogu.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Mu teg ca ne taalibe ba: «Sa yaay a ngoogu.» Ca waxtu woowa tembe la taalibe ba yóbbu soxna sa këram.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu saay na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Gannaaw loolu Yeesu xam ne lépp sotti na, mu daldi ne: «Mar naa!» ngir matal la Mbind ma indi woon ci mbiram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Taalifi cant</char> 69.22.</note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ndab lu fees ak bineegar a nga fa tege woon. Ñu jël ab sagar, xooj ko ca, lonk ko ci caru garabu isob, tàllal ko ba mu jot gémmiñam. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yeesu nag muucu bineegar ba, daldi ne: «Sotti na!» Ci kaw loolu mu sëgal bopp ba, daldi yiwi noo ga.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Waajalu <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> la woon, te bésub Noflaay warula fekk néew ya ca bant ba, ndax bés bu màgg la ci Yawut ñi. Ñu ñaan <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char>, mu dammlu tànki ña ñu daaj, ngir jële leen fa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Takk-der ya dikk, damm tànki kenn ka ñu daajaaleek Yeesu, teg ca keneen ka. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ñu agsi ci Yeesu, daldi gis ne dee na ba noppi, ba tax dammuñu ay tànkam. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Teewul kenn ca takk-der ya jam ko ab xeej ci faar yi, deret ànd ak ndox tuuru ca saa sa. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ki joxeb seedeem ci mbir yooyii, moo ci teg bëtam, te kàddug seedeem dëgg la. Moom ci boppam, xam na ne dëgg lay wax, te moo ci joxe kàddug seedeem, ngir yeen itam ngeen gëm. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Loola moo am ngir Mbind mi indi woon lii, sotti: «Benn yaxam, deesu ko damm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Mucc ga</char> 12.46.</note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Meneen Mbind indeeti ne: «Dinañu gis ki ñu jam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Sàkkaryaa</char> 12.10.</note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rob nañu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Gannaaw loolu Yuusufa ma dëkk Arimate, di taalibeb Yeesu bu làqu ndax ragal njiiti Yawut ya, moom moo ñaan <char style="w" lemma="Pilaat:">Pilaat</char> mu may ko mu yóbbu néewub Yeesu. Pilaat may ko ko. Yuusufa nag dem, yóbbu néewub Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodem itam ànd ak moom, indaale lu wara tollook fanweeri kiloy cuuraayal njafaan lu ñu defare ndàbbu miir ak <char style="w" lemma="alowes:">alowes</char>. Nikodem moomu jëkkoon naa seetsi Yeesu ag guddi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ñu jël néewub Yeesu, lëmëse ko sori lẽe, defaale ca cuuraay la, na ko Yawut ya baaxoo woon ci waajtaayu rob. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Foofa ñu daajoon Yeesu, ab tool a nga fa, ab <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> bu bees bu ñu yatt ciw doj a nga ca tool ba, te maseesu caa denc ab néew. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Foofa lañu denc Yeesu, gannaaw jege woon na, te ci Waajalu <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> lañu nekkoon.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu Almasi bi dekki na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Bésub dibéer, ba jiitu ca ayu bésu Yawut ya, Maryaama teela xëy dem, ba bët setagul, ba ca <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> ba. Mu gis ne randal nañu doj wa ñu ube woon bàmmeel ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Mu daldi daw, ba ca Simoŋ Piyeer ak ca beneen taalibe ba, ka Yeesu soppoon. Mu ne leen: «Jële nañu Sang bi ca bàmmeel ba, te xamunu fu ñu ko def.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Piyeer ak beneen taalibe ba dem wuti bàmmeel ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ñu ànd daw, beneen taalibe ba nag gëna gaaw Piyeer, jëkk ko ca bàmmeel ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Naka la sëgg, yër, daldi séen sori càngaay ya ca suuf, te duggul ca biir bàmmeel ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoŋ Piyeer ma ca topp, agsi, jàll ca biir, daldi gis sori càngaay la tege, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ak kaala ga ñu muure woon boppu Yeesu. Kaala ga nag àndul ak sori càngaay la; dees koo taxañ, mu tege. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ci noonu beneen taalibe ba njëkkoona agsi ca bàmmeel ba, duggsi moom itam. Mu gis, daldi gëm. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Ndax kat ba booba, taalibe ya xamaguñu dëgg tekkitel Mbind ma indi woon ne fàww Yeesu dekki. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Taalibe ya nag ñibbi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu feeñu na Maryaamam Magdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ci biir loolu Maryaamaa nga ca <char style="w" lemma="bàmmeel b-:">bàmmeel</char> ba, ca biti, di jooy. Ci biir jooy yi la sëgg, yër ca biir bàmmeel ba, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />daldi séen ñaari malaaka yu sol yére yu weex, toog fa néewub Yeesu tëddoon, kii fa féeteek fa bopp ba nekkoon, kee ca tànk ya. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ñu ne ko: «Ndaw si, looy jooy?» Mu ne leen: «Samab Sang lañu yóbbu, te xawma fu ñu ko denc.»<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Naka la wax loolu daldi walbatiku, gis Yeesu mu taxaw, te xamul ne Yeesu la. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yeesu ne ko: «Ndaw sii, looy jooy? Kooy seet?» Mu foog ne boroom tool baa, ne ko: «Góor gi, su fekkee yaa ko yóbbu, wax ma foo ko denc, maa koy jëli.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yeesu ne ko: «Maryaama.» Mu geestu, làkk ko ci yawut ne ko: «Rabbuni!» Muy firi kilifa gi.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yeesu ne ko: «Bu ma langaamu, ndax yéegeeguma fa Baay ba. Waaye demal, ne samay bokk, maa ngi yéegi ca sama Baay biy seen Baay, sama Yàlla jiy seen Yàlla.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ba loolu amee Maryaama ma dëkk Magdala dem, ne taalibe ya: «Gis naa Sang bi!» Ci kaw loolu mu wax leen yóbbanteem.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu feeñu na taalibe yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Bésub dibéer googu ca ngoon, di bés bi jiitu ci ayu bésu Yawut ya, bunt yaa nga tëje fa taalibe ya daje, ndax ragal njiiti Yawut ya. Yeesu ne jimeet taxaw ci seen biir ne leen: «Jàmm seen!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Loolu la Yeesu wax, daldi leen won ay loxoom akug wetam. Taalibe ya nag bég lool ndax la ñu gis Sang bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yeesu dellu ne leen: «Jàmm ngeen! Ni ma Baay bi yebale, noonu laa leen yebale, man itam.»<verse eid="JHN 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Naka la wax loolu, daldi leen ëf ngelawal gémmiñam, ne leen: «Jëlleen <char style="w" lemma="Noo gu Sell g-:">Noo gu Sell</char> gi. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Képp ku ngeen baal ay bàkkaaram, baalees na ko; képp ku ngeen topp ay bàkkaaram, toppees na ko.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu yedd na Tomaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Kenn ca Fukk ñaak ñaar nag, di Tomaa ma ñuy wax Didimus, muy firi Seex bi, ba Yeesu dikkee, moom nekku fa woon. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Moo tax ba ko taalibe ya nee: «Gis nanu Sang bi!» da ne leen: «Su ma gisul màndargam pont yi ciy loxoom, ba ne ci duut baaraam, boole ci ne tegg loxo cig wetam, duma ko gëm mukk.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ba ñu ca tegee juróom ñetti fan, taalibey Yeesu ya dajewaat ca biir, Tomaa nekk faak ñoom. Yeesu ne jimeet ca seen biir, te bunt ya tëje. Mu ne leen: «Jàmm ngeen!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ci kaw loolu mu ne Tomaa: «Tegal fii sa baaraam te xool samay loxo; te nga tàllal sa loxo, ne ko tegg ci samag wet. Bàyyil gëmadi te gëm.» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomaa àddu ne ko: «Yaa di sama Boroom, di sama Yàlla!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yeesu ne ko: «Danga maa gis, ba tax nga gëm? Ndokkalee ñi gëm te gisuñu!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Bare na firnde yeneen yu Yeesu def fi kanam taalibe yi, te bindeesu ko ci téere bii. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Lii nag lañu bind, ngir ngeen gëm ne Yeesu mooy <char style="w" lemma="Almasi b-:">Almasi</char> bi, <char style="w" lemma="Doomu Yàlla j-:">Doomu Yàlla</char>, ngir itam ngeen jagoo ag dund ndax aw turam.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeesu feeñu na juróom ñaari taalibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Gannaaw loolu, Yeesu feeñooti na ay taalibeem ca tàkkal dex ga ñuy wax Tiberyàdd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">dexu Tiberyàdd </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy dexu Galile.</char></note>. Na mu feeñee nii la. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Ña bokkoon daje benn béreb ñoo di Simoŋ Piyeer, ak Tomaa mi ñuy wax Seex bi, ak Natanayel ma dëkk Kana gu diiwaanu Galile, ak doomi Sebede, ak yeneen ñaari taalibe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoŋ Piyeer ne leen: «Maa ngi nappi.» Ñu ne ko: «Nan ànd ak yaw, nun itam.» Ñu dem, daldi dugg gaal. Guddi googu jàppuñu dara.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ba fajar jotee Yeesu taxaw ca tàkk ga, te taalibe ya xamuñu ne moom la. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yeesu ne leen: «Bokk yi, ndax am ngeen jën?» Ñu ne ko: «Déedéet.» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Mu ne leen: «Sànnileen mbaal mi ci ndijooru gaal gi, ba daj.» Ci kaw loolu ñu sànni, ba noppi amatuñu dooley xëcc mbaal mi ndax jën yu bare.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ba loolu amee taalibe ba Yeesu soppoon ne Piyeer: «Sang bi la!» Ba Simoŋ Piyeer déggee loolu, fekk ko ak col gu woyof, mu laxasaay ko ba mu dëgër, daldi sóobu ca dex ga. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Yeneen taalibe ya nag dikk ak gaal ga, xëccaale mbaal ma fees dell ak jën, ndax sorewuñu woon tàkk ga; lu wara tollu ci téeméeri meetar a doxoon seen diggante ak tàkk ga.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ba ñu teersee, ab taalu këriñ lañu gis, aw jën tege ca, ak mburu ca wet ga. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yeesu ne leen: «Indileen ci jën yi ngeen jàpp.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoŋ Piyeer nag yéeg ca gaal ga, daldi diri mbaal ma ca tàkk ga, mu fees dell ak jën yu mag; lépp di téeméeri jën ak juróom fukk ak ñett (153). Te noonu mu baree taxul mbaal ma xëtt. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yeesu ne leen: «Ñëwleen ndékki.» Kenn ca taalibe ya nag ñemewu ko woon ne ko: «Yaay kan?» Ndax xamoon nañu ne Sang bee. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yeesu dikk, jël mburu, jox leen, jox leen jën itam. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Boobu mooy ñetteelu yoon bu Yeesu feeñoo taalibe ya, gannaaw ba mu dekkee.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu sas na Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ba ñu ndékkee ba noppi, Yeesu da ne Simoŋ Piyeer: «Simoŋ doomu Yowaan, ndax yaa ma gëna sopp ñii?» Mu ne ko: «Waawaaw, Sang bi, yaw, xam nga ne bëgg naa la.» Mu ne ko: «Xontal ma sama mbote yi.»<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Mu waxaat ko ñaareel bi yoon, ne ko: «Simoŋ doomu Yowaan, ndax sopp nga ma?» Mu ne ko: «Waawaaw, Sang bi, yaw, xam nga ne bëgg naa la.» Mu ne ko: «Sàmmal ma samay xar.»<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Mu neeti ko ñetteel bi yoon: «Simoŋ doomu Yowaan, bëgg nga maam?» Piyeer nag tiislu la ko Yeesu laaj ba ñetti yoon: «Ndax bëgg nga ma?» Piyeer ne ko: «Sang bi, yaw xam nga lépp; xam nga ne bëgg naa la.» Yeesu ne ko: «Xontal ma samay xar. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Maa la ko wax déy ci lu wér, ba nga dee ndaw, yaay takkal sa bopp sa geño, dem fu la neex. Waaye boo màggatee, dinga tàllal say loxo, keneen takkal la sa geño, yóbbu la foo bëggul.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kàddu yooyu la Yeesu misaale na Piyeer di deeweji deewin wu muy terale Yàlla. Loolu la wax ba noppi ne ko: «Toppal ci man!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Piyeer geestu, gis taalibe ba Yeesu soppoon, mu topp ca ñoom. Taalibe boobu mooy ka sóonu woon, ba tafu ca dënnub Yeesu, ba ñuy lekk, te moo ko laajoon ne ko: «Sang bi, kan moo lay wor?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ba ko Piyeer gisee da ne Yeesu: «Sang bi, kii nag?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yeesu ne ko: «Moom, su ma bëggoon mu dund ba kera ma délsi, ana lu ciy sa yoon? Yaw kay, toppal ci man.»<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kàddu googu nag doxe ca, law ca biir bokki taalibe ya, ñu jàpp ne taalibe boobu du dee. Ndaxam Yeesu waxul Piyeer ne kooku du dee, waaye da ne: «Su ma bëggee mu dund, ba kera ma délsi, ana lu ciy sa yoon?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Taalibe boobu moo seede mbir yooyu, moo bind xew-xew yooyu, te xam nanu ne kàddug seedeem dëgg la.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Bare na itam yeneen yu Yeesu def, te su ñu ko doon bind benn-benn, jàpp naa ne àddina ci boppam sax du mana denc téere ya ñu ko bind.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>